  ('اتصال صنعت میانه', 'esmcell.com', 'Info@esmcell.com', 'ESM Telecommunication', 'Production of all kinds of SIM card-compatible and optical modems', 'It was established and relying on technical knowledge and innovative approach in 1390, it is known as one of the leading actors in the country''s telecommunication field. This company is a provider of advanced and modern telecommunication solutions and services, and by using the latest technologies, it supplies professional equipment to the telecommunication market. The production of second, third, and fourth generation SIM card modems was started in 1998. Itasat Sanat Mianeh started with the brand "Linotech" in 2018 and is currently operating as one of the domestic producers of these products in the country. This company''s focus on quality, innovation and responding to the needs of the market has created a special place for it in the telecommunications industry.', 'Mohammad Jabri, Mohsen Abui Mehrizi', 'CAT 6 SIM card modem', 'Industrial automation, machine-to-machine communication'),
  ('آرا الکترونیک افزار', 'Araafzar.com', 'sale@araafzar.com', 'Electronic votes', 'Design and production of electronic boards', 'With the aim of designing and producing electronic systems and 1383, Ara Electronics Company was established in the year of computer and obtaining representation from domestic and foreign companies. By implementing commercial and industrial projects inside and outside the country, this company has been able to become one of the largest electronic companies in Iran and be among the knowledge-based companies. Ara Electronics has achieved a worthy position in the field of production and import of various branches of electricity and electronics. This group is ready to provide all types of specialized electronic services to domestic companies and manufacturers.', 'Reza Nosrati', 'No knowledge-based product', 'Production of industrial electronic equipment'),
