  ('آژند پردازش بامن', 'samfaa.ir', NULL, 'Baman''s processing agenda', 'Governance systems and digital infrastructures of the culture and art industry - information and communication technology', 'Baman Processing Agenda Company operates in the field of information and communication technology, focusing on the design of scalable software systems and digital infrastructures, and by taking advantage of modern architectures and internal technical capabilities, it provides solutions in accordance with governance and organizational needs. The flagship product of this company, Iran Cinema Sales and Screening Management System (SEMFA), as the national infrastructure of ticket sales management and cinema statistical system, plays an important role in creating transparency, data integrity and facilitating monitoring. Baman''s processing agenda, relying on internal research and development, open source technologies and current standards, provides stable, secure and expandable solutions for current and future needs.', 'Seyed Nasser Mousavi Jazayeri, Hossein Nazimi Bidgoli, Seyed Alireza Ghafouri', 'The Samfa system has a certificate of technical registration Software and certificates related to security requirements is', 'Data processing, analytical software'),
  ('اندیشه های فرانگر برسام', 'bgsco.net', 'Info@bgsco.ir', 'Barsam global systems', ', along with PLC and PTN energy management systems, SDH telecommunication and data transmission systems, including', '(EPC & Procurement) (a leader in engineering, supply of BGS equipment) is Barsam Engineering Company, and the integration of telecommunication and industrial systems in the fields of electricity, oil and gas, transportation of new energy and critical infrastructure. This company, with more than a decade of experience in national and regional SDH/PDH, MPLS-TP projects, provides specialized industrial telecommunication solutions including (NMS) equipment, multi-service multiplexers, industrial switches and network management systems. Bersam''s capabilities include network design, equipment selection, training and periodic services, and with operational offices in Iran, Turkey and the UAE, Bersam provides sustainable, secure and scalable solutions that cover current and future infrastructure needs.', 'Gaffari''s message', 'Creating an alarm window with the ability to send data on | SCADA protocols for reading in systems Monitoring (this product is in the stage of introduction to the knowledge-based organization and is being evaluated).', 'Data analysis and smart solutions'),
