  ('بیستون تلکام', 'btel.ir', 'info@btel.ir', 'Btel-Group', '(with the brand name Bistun Telecom 1384: the date of establishment of new communication technologies, design and creation of telecommunication data centers, creation of data transmission infrastructure, design and implementation of smart cities, and monitoring, monitoring and data analysis of data centers', 'In the past year, the knowledge-based company of Bistoon Communication Development (Bistoon Telecom) has been operating in the field of new communication technologies and providing advanced products with economic efficiency. This company provides services including the design of telecommunication data centers, the development of data transmission infrastructure, the implementation of smart cities, and the monitoring and analysis of data centers. Beeston Telecom was introduced as the best technical and engineering company in the country and its CEO was also recognized as the best entrepreneur. This company was included in the list of innovative knowledge-based companies of the country with the product "Intelligent data monitoring, monitoring and control system" with the brand 1400 in the year of Green Node. Biston Telecom''s activities include electricity, electronics, photonics, telecommunications and automatic systems', 'Mohammad Reza Alikhani, Morteza Safari, Kianoosh Kakai', NULL, 'Organizational communication services, telecommunication networks. The company is knowledge-based'),
  ('پارس پویش فن آور', 'parspooyesh.com', 'info@parspooyesh.com', 'parspooyesh', 'Provider of network software solutions and internet user management', 'In 1382, Pars Poish Fanavor Company started its activity in the field of software solutions development, specializing in the communication industry, and by focusing on innovation and compliance with global standards, this company has gained a prestigious position in the telecom market as one of IBSng. The product is known as one of the main user management and charging systems in the country, and it has been upgraded in different IBSng-E over generations with a modular and scalable architecture. The advanced version of operators such as Mobile First, Irancell, Iran Telecom, Asiatec and Mobinnet are used. This solution has become one of the important local products in the country''s infrastructure projects and has entered the field of network traffic analysis and FlowInsight. Pars Powish has also become intelligent by offering monitoring products and has completed its portfolio of products in the network and data center layer.', 'Farshad Khoshkhoi Zahtab', ') (enterprise and cloud version of IBSng | Mita | Flow Insight | Rebin IPDR', 'IT development of technological software and service export'),
  ('پاژداده پردازان سپند آسا', 'Pazhdadeh.ir', 'Pazhdadeh@gmail.com', 'Sepand Asa data processors', 'The field of information and communication technology and computer software', 'With the aim of transforming the systems in 1391, Sepand Asa Pajdata Pardazan Company started its activity from the organizational year and created a native, flexible and open-text platform, based on the upper documents of the Ministry of Communications and Information Technology. In the early years, relying on the power of young professionals, this company succeeded in developing a native framework and open source, and then based on it, it implemented comprehensive organizational systems (with microservices architecture and the approach of providing services independent of time and place, design and ERP). Currently, this platform with the brand names "My Organization" and "Power Portal" has been deployed in several public and private organizations and is continuously being developed and improved.', 'Mohsen Shajari, Marzieh Tash Rooh', 'Niro portal - comprehensive organizational portal (my organization', 'Data analysis and software systems'),
  ('پرتو ارتباط صبا', 'pesaba.com', 'admin@pesaba.com', 'Saba communication beam', 'Communication and network security', 'In 2017, Danesh Banyan Perto Communication Saba started its activity in the field of equipment design and production in the year of telecommunication and network security solutions and by focusing on the localization of strategic technologies, it has become one of the specialized actors in this field. The mission of this company is to provide advanced technical solutions to improve the security of the country''s communication networks, and in this way, it benefits from a team of experts with doctorate and master''s degrees. Saba communication beam with the aim of industrial synergy is a member of the Iran Telecommunications Industry Syndicate, the country''s Computer Trade Union Organization and the Association for the Security of Production Space and Information Exchange. This company has also managed to receive approvals and specialized licenses from related institutions and has provided the possibility of extensive cooperation with government and private organizations of the country.', 'Morteza Mohammadpour, Mehran Salmani', NULL, 'Telecommunication projects and communication infrastructure. The company is knowledge-based'),
  ('پگاه آفتاب', 'Pegaheaftab.com', 'info@pegaheaftab.com', 'pegaheaftab', 'The company''s mission is to provide technological solutions for digital transformation, especially in equipment-oriented industries, along with engineering, consulting, design and production services, commercial and financing activities.', 'AI and IT, IoT years of experience in providing 25 Pegah Aftab solutions are a knowledge-based company with more than 50% power plants to the country''s industries. Focusing on industrial digital transformation, this company has covered more than infrastructure industries and reduced dependence on foreign technologies. Its most important products include industrial power plant, artificial intelligence technical assistant, and ERP platform. The diversity and integration of IoT, business automation and online monitoring systems based on solutions, together with the technical knowledge of human resources, has made Pegah Aftab a reliable partner of organizations in digital transformation.', 'The late Seyyed Ahmad Mirfakhrai, Jafar Mirzaei', 'The knowledge base of the technology has been evaluated', 'Industrial digital and media solutions and its modules as an ERP solution'),
  ('پیام گستر فاوا', 'karasite.ir', 'info@payamgostar.ir', 'Payam Gostar Fava', 'Production and supply of all kinds of software and hardware', 'Danesh Banyan Payam Gostar Company, with an information technology production license from the Ministry of Industry, Mines and Trade and specialized experience in the field of traffic control and physical protection, provides comprehensive security and regulation software "Dezhban" and its functional modules using artificial intelligence and modern technologies. This system provides facilities such as registration and reservation of traffic of clients, cars and goods, registration of guard board, shift reports and control of personnel and contractors traffic. In addition to ISO9001, Payam Gostar has succeeded in obtaining CE standards for the production of all kinds of standard traffic control gates. Also, this company has developed "Kara" and ISO10002 capillary distribution and accounting software and "Saman" customer relationship management software, which is used in coffee shops, restaurants and food industry.', 'Hossein Abedin', '. The company is knowledge-based', 'Organizational ICT communication services, solutions'),
  ('پیشگامان فرا رسانه سروش', 'nitechpark.com', 'Info@nitechpark.com', 'Soroush trans media pioneers', 'Information and communication technology and digital content production', 'Pishgaman Fara Media Soroush Company was established in Mashhad and with the license of the computer trade union system in 2009 and started its activity in the field of information and communication technology. This company provides a variety of services with optimal quality with expert staff in technical, support, research and development departments and 35 utilization of more than commercial. Providing value-added services and information technology applications on the platform of various media such as web, mobile phone, radio and television is one of its areas of activity. Soroush plays an active role in the development of education, trade, health and electronic business. It also acts as a technology growth center by providing communication infrastructure and supporting the creation of start-up businesses. Expert and knowledge-oriented human capital is the main axis of the business strategy and the most important competitive advantage of this company', 'Saeed Moghadam Aryaei', 'Happy / safe family', 'Digital content production, multimedia platforms'),
  ('ترسیم داده افزار', 'tarsimdade.com', 'tarsimdadeh@gmail.com', 'tarism-dade-afzar', 'Software', 'Danesh Banyan Tarsim Dataware Company operates with the aim of developing a knowledge-based economy and commercializing the results of research and development in the field of information technology, and with extensive experience in designing and deploying integrated systems, it has implemented numerous projects at the national level. The main fields of SaaS (big data processing and analysis) include providing cloud computing services with business intelligence tools, producing advanced organizational systems and designing production line infrastructure and X-Stone. Data drawing products are developed based on the exclusive infrastructure of SPL (integrated production line software) and provide the possibility of producing diverse, scalable and knowledge-based systems. By relying on local technical power, this company is able to meet the needs of the domestic market and have an effective and competitive presence in international markets.', 'Seyyed Mahmoud Mahmoudi Khansari', 'X-stone software production infrastructure', 'Data visualization and analytical software'),
  ('توسعه تکنولوژی آموزشی دانش آوران خراسان', 'daneshavaran.ir', 'info@daneshavaran.ir', 'danesh-avaran1888952-a3', 'Manufacturer of touch monitors, kiosks and touch stands with Karako brand, manufacturer of board..., Houshmand Pars, seller and operator of video conference systems.', 'Danesh Banyan Danesh Avaran Company operates in the field of intelligent educational equipment and interactive solutions and was formed with the aim of improving the quality of education and organizational information. Relying on technical experience, expert engineers and innovative approach, this company has gained a prestigious position in the country''s smart equipment industry. The main focus of the scholars is on the production of educational smart boards, touch screens and the design of various kiosks and information stands and services that are supplied with standard manufacturing quality and customization capabilities. In addition to production, this complex is also active in the commercial field of smart display equipment and follows the development of regional markets and exports. The continuous investment in research and development, the use of expert human resources and technical support has made Awars one of the most effective companies in the digital transformation and promotion of educational and organizational services in the country.', 'Reza Jafar Tabatabai, Fariba Razavi', NULL, 'Pars smart board of electronic education systems, educational content Digital'),
  ('توسعه زیر ساخت های فناوری اطالعات سیگما', 'sigma.ir', 'dm@sigma.ir', 'Development of Sigma technology information infrastructures', 'This knowledge-based company provides secure information technology services, including portals and cloud computing, artificial intelligence, digital consulting, cyber security and credit rating.', 'Years of experience and rank of one informatics, works in the field of production and support of 21 Sigma knowledge-based companies with customized software and consulting. This company offers products and services including portal, secure organization, secure cloud computing, intelligent processing of video, image and text with artificial intelligence, information technology consulting (digital transformation, e-government, efficiency optimization and private participation), cyber security and credit rating. During two decades of activity, Sigma has offered its services to the largest organizations and private institutions in the country and has always tried to advance the goals of its customers.', 'Ali Kazemi', 'Sigma portal Sigma cloud', 'Development of information technology infrastructure'),
  ('توسعه سامانه های آرتیان توس', 'artianhpc.ir', 'info@artianhpc.ir', 'artian-hpc', 'Production of native communication and processing equipment', 'As the first domestic server manufacturer in Iran, Artian Toos Systems Development Company has developed technical knowledge and design and production of all main and secondary electronic boards of its server product. Artian''s native server with its unique and distributed architecture has a distinct competitive advantage, especially in terms of price, compared to other competitors. In addition to this product, the company (produces SMT Line) Artian, having an advanced assembly line of electronic boards, has produced other indigenous knowledge-based products, such as thin client and wireless access point.', 'Ali Kamyar, Mohsen Kamyar, Hamid Nouri', 'Artian Native Server, Artian Access Point, Tin | Colin Artyan', 'Development of advanced software systems'),
  ('توسعه سامانه های رایانه سماتوس', 'samatoos.ir', 'Info@samatoos.ir', 'Samatoos', 'Information and communication technology - development and launch of information management systems, especially in the software dimension, consulting services in the field of the company - buying, selling and producing any kind of software, hardware -', 'With the aim of producing native software and creating frameworks in 1383, the knowledge-based company Samatos has entered the country''s software industry and has more than 20 years of experience in this field of design and implementation. This company produces integrated organizational software in the field of administrative automation and management with a team of experts and IT graduates from Sharif and Ferdowsi Universities of Technology in Mashhad. Somatos has succeeded in obtaining knowledge base license, BPMS license (business process of software operation) and security certificate from Fata and has won top ranks in festivals and national and provincial competitions. This company is a member of the computer trade union system and the union of representatives of Khorasan Razavi consulting centers and by focusing on knowledge, skill and commitment, it covers the needs of customers. has provided a large', 'Saeed Moghadzade, Bezaz, Mohsen Kamiyar, Ahmad Akbari, Dasht Beyaz', NULL, 'The electronic organization of Linked ERP integrated software systems, solutions'),
  ('توسعه فناوری لوتوس شبکه', 'Lotusnet.ir', 'info@lotusnet.ir', 'Development of Lotus Network technology', '(IT) information technology', 'Using the power and experience of its experts, Lotus Net provides design and setup services for data centers and provides organizational services for large companies and organizations. These services include installation, setup and implementation of active and passive equipment, support and maintenance of network infrastructure and data centers, development of dedicated security software systems, provision and generator, providing UPS camera services, electrical services for data centers including electrical wiring, switchboards and digital content traffic distribution. Also, by having an experienced team in the field of network, security, programming, service, hosting and digital content distribution services, the company offers its specialized consulting to government organizations and small and large companies. In addition, Lotus Net provides full and professional network implementation services with the support and maintenance team.', 'Fateme Sadeghi Mitra Khazli, Marzieh Azizi Niaser Farshad Lak', 'No knowledge-based product', 'IT network services, security and infrastructure'),
  ('تولیدی و مهندسی ایده آل مهدبان', 'mahdban.com', 'mahdavifar@mahdban.com', 'Mahdban ideal production and engineering', 'Design and manufacture of electronic equipment', 'In the field of monitoring environmental conditions, Ideal Manufacturing and Engineering Company of Mehdban has been operating since 1389 and offers specialized and customized products with a focus on smartness, energy optimization and resource management. This company has gained customer satisfaction by attending domestic and foreign exhibitions, providing warranty and after-sales services, and continuous product development through research and development. Also, by using Internet of Things technology and setting up a dedicated broker, it provides stable and uninterrupted services to customers', 'Zohra Bani, Mohammad Reza Mahdavi Far', 'All products related to monitoring systems are considered basic knowledge', 'Technology engineering services, systems design industrial'),
  ('تیم یار', 'teamyar.com', 'info@teamyar.com', 'company/teamyarerp', 'Production and support of Timyar integrated comprehensive business management software', 'Timyar Company is a knowledge-based company active in the field of enterprise software development, focusing on providing integrated solutions, smartening and optimizing business processes. Relying on continuous research and development, this company provides various solutions in the fields of human resource management, finance, sales, operations and organizational remote work. Timyar has moved in the direction of digital transformation of organizations by using technical knowledge, executive experience and understanding the needs of the market, and its goal is to create an integrated platform to increase productivity, agility and intelligent management in businesses.', 'Mr. Majid Naqdinia', NULL, 'Organizational collaboration platforms and team management Teamyar ERP software'),
  ('خبره پرداز پارس', 'kpp.ir', 'info@kpp.ir', 'Expert Pars', 'Software production', 'With the aim of developing practical software systems in 1375, Pars Expert Company was established in administrative and industrial sectors and its activities are focused on new technology, sustainable development and customer orientation. After years of experience, this company has focused on the banking sector and 15 ready-to-use systems and payment systems.', 'Reza Fekri, Mohsen Rahimi', 'Corporate banking Boom customers club', 'Specialized and analytical software'),
  ('خوارزم ارتباط خاورمیانه', 'algocom.net', 'sales@algocom.net', 'Khorezm Middle East communication', 'Satellite and terrestrial telecommunications, designing, manufacturing and supplying equipment to provide comprehensive and integrated solutions', 'Based on the technical knowledge of Farvardin 20, 1374, Knowledge-based company of Middle Eastern communication in history and committed and efficient forces was established by a group of activists of the telecommunications industry. Since its establishment, this company has successfully completed numerous and noteworthy projects in providing technical and engineering services, research and development in telecommunication systems. It is worth noting that this company has successfully completed hundreds of projects for different employers and clients, such as Iran Space Organization, Iran Space Research Institute, Iran Telecommunications Companies, Islamic Republic of Iran Railways, universities, radio and television, regional power companies, Iran Scientific and Industrial Research Organization, Ministry of Housing and Urban Development, news reports, Municipality, oil and gas companies, regional water and electricity companies, ports and shipping organization, and banks.', 'Mohammad Reza Mehrabi Bayan', NULL, 'Providing comprehensive telecommunications and satellite solutions. The company is knowledge-based'),
  ('راهبر نیروی خراسان (رانیر)', 'Ranirco.com', 'info@ranirco.com', 'Commander of the Khorasan Force (Ranir)', 'Production and support of customer order software', 'In the form of mechanical services of the electricity company in 1346, Rahbar Nirvi Khorasan started its activity in Khorasan region. With the gradual development of systems for issuing accounting bills, collecting and maintaining subscribers'' accounts, from manual methods to the implementation of advanced software and hardware, today, after more than four decades of activity, this company has become one of the most specialized operators of electricity subscriber systems in the country. Khorasan Power Manager is responsible for providing electricity services by setting up a power distribution company with 9 million subscribers in 5.5 seven operating sites. This company has a privileged position in the country and especially in the east of Iran, with the use of expert manpower and the first rank of the country''s Informatics Council, in areas such as production and support of customized software, data network, consulting and monitoring of IT projects and support services.', 'Iraj Alig, Behrouz Jalili', 'Comprehensive service system for electricity subscribers (Pulse | )', 'Resource management systems and operations'),
  ('رهیاب فن آوا', 'rahyabtelecom.com', 'm.tajmiri@rahyabtelecom.com', 'Pathfinder of sound technology', 'At the organizational level, designing and developing solutions for large organizations for telecommunication operators, banks and OSS', 'In the field of design and construction, Rehiab Fan Ava Company (Special Shares) started its activity in 2010 and produced telecommunication, electronic and software equipment. Initially, this company produced SS7, TDM/IP signaling converters, systems such as low-capacity and high-capacity telephone centers and other telecommunication equipment, the role of MSAN, Thin Client, PRI, CAS, E&M equipment, and at the same time, with the increase of 1388, it played an effective role in the localization of key telecommunication technologies. Since the country''s operators needed operation management software, the company''s main focus shifted from hardware equipment production to research, design and implementation of business, operational and organizational processes as well. This change in approach led to the development of Ava technology software as OSS/BSS. OSS is one of the few local companies with practical experience in the field', 'Esra Emami Mohammad Taj Miri, Mohammad Ali Taj Miri', 'The product "Operation and Management Support System | Aroosha OSS/(Aroosha Information Technology Services | Is 1)" has ITSM type knowledge base approval', 'GIS positioning systems, navigation and'),
  ('سرزمین هوشمند پاد', 'podium.ir', 'info@podium.ir', 'podium-ir', 'ICT information and communication technology', 'The Smart Land Company, a subsidiary of Pasargad Bank, was founded by the elites of 1401 in the university year and started its activity focusing on the development of financial channels. With the evolution of missions, the company turned to providing new lifestyle experiences and developing innovative financial services. Today, as one of the serious players in digital banking, Pod focuses on creating digital and data-driven platforms. In this regard, Pasargad Ecosystem Bank has developed "Pasargad Digital Economy Platform (PAD)". This smart ecosystem covers areas such as tourism, education, health, logistics, agriculture and energy. Pod platform provides integrated services to users and businesses by relying on financial and banking infrastructure.', 'Pasargad Bank', NULL, 'Podium API Bazarche IoT smart city and'),
  ('ساتا-سالمت الکترونیکی تامین', 'satahealth.com', 'info@satahealth.com', 'Sata-health electronic supply', 'Electronic health', 'Health Electronic Security Company (SATA) is a knowledge-based and leading company in the field of technology. It has a history of 10 years of implementation of social security organizations, which operates with health information IT and the arm of national projects. This company has played an important role in the development of electronic health by establishing and customizing the comprehensive information system (in social security treatment centers and implementing the electronic prescription plan since HIS). Relying on 1395 young and capable specialists, SATA has designed and implemented various software solutions in order to optimize treatment processes and support systems, handling HIS documents. Currently, in addition to medicine, it also offers comprehensive systems for offices and clinics to its customers.', 'Social Security Organization', NULL, 'Digital health systems. The company is knowledge-based'),
  ('شبکه افزار', 'shabakeafzar.com', 'info@shabakeafzar.com', 'shabakehafzar', 'The company''s activities include design, implementation and support of network, infrastructure and data centers, network security and information systems, production and support of UPS, telecommunication systems and IT consulting and training, custom software, data management and analysis, purchase and service of equipment, Fava projects and participation in specialized exhibitions and events.', 'On the basis of ICT, the network company was established with the aim of providing comprehensive solutions and specialized services in the field. The basis of the company''s activity in 1371 was the use of modern informatics methodologies in the year of Networkware, based on the use of experienced experts and the most up-to-date equipment in the implementation of information and communication technology projects, and on this basis, relying on internal talents and using equipment from the most reliable brands of network equipment manufacturers, gradually in the early years of its activity, it became a reliable brand in the field of providing reliable and diverse services and products related to this field. Due to the belief of the company''s board of directors regarding specialization and the use of expert forces, all the experts of this company in the technical and engineering units have received international certificates related to the solutions used.', 'Mahmoud Reza Sharai', 'No knowledge-based product', 'Design and implementation of computer networks'),
  ('شتابدهنده فناوری های مالی نوآفرین', 'noafarinac.ir', 'ceo@noafarinfa.com', 'Noafarin Fintech Accelerator', 'Information and communication technology, acceleration and development of commercialization services', 'Accelerator of innovative financial technologies is a platform to transform innovative ideas in the field of fintech into real and scalable businesses. Focusing on fields such as ICT, payment RegTech, digital banking, artificial intelligence, big data, blockchain, information security, this accelerator accompanies startups from the idea stage to entering the market and sustainable development. By providing specialized mentoring, smart seed capital and technical infrastructure, Noafrin provides the path of targeted growth for teams. Direct connection to a network of banks, financial institutions, technology companies and investors is one of the key advantages of this accelerator. Teams enter the acceleration process with a clear business model and a clear financial plan. Innovation is an environment for the growth of startups that think of solving real market problems and entering the industrial scale.', 'Samia Khosh Sarwar, Ali Ghasemi', 'Innovative accelerator in the field of acceleration and development The areas of innovation have a knowledge-based license', 'Development of export-oriented fintech startups'),
  ('طراحان سفید فردا ایرانیان', 'whitedesigners.ir', 'info@whitedesigners.ir', 'wdstudios', 'Creative industries, digital games, blockchain, education', 'Farda Iranian White Designers Company (abbreviated as Sefid Designers) is one of the pioneers of advanced software industries, creators and technologies in Iran. With more than a decade of experience as a knowledge-based company in fields such as digital games, gamification, organizational artificial intelligence, meeting management systems, animation, blockchain, and specialized training for creative industries, Khaliq operates. Sefid Designers is recognized as one of the top collections in the country in the field of creative and innovative industries by using a team of experts, creators and experienced people. By creating a dynamic environment, the forces of this company have provided a suitable platform for cultivating new and different ideas', 'Sadegh Jabali', 'Falcon game ) fighting game (Heroes of Sistan', 'User experience design and digital products'),
  ('فناوران به آفرین ترنج', 'toranjinotec.com', 'info@toranjinotec.com', 'Well done technicians', 'Preparation, production and sale of software for the insurance industry', 'Danesh Banian Fanavaran Company develops digital, data-driven and scalable solutions in the field of medical insurance with the aim of smartening and re-creating the operational processes of the insurance industry. By creating an integrated ecosystem, this company provides secure and real-time communication between insurance companies, policyholders, insureds and medical centers and replaces traditional and paper-based processes. Taking advantage of advanced automation, data analysis, rules engine and cloud infrastructure has made Tranj a leader in insurtech and digital health. The company''s focus is on reducing operating costs, increasing accuracy and transparency in handling claims, and improving the experience of the insured. Microservice architecture and modern technologies guarantee maximum efficiency and customer orientation of insurance systems. Also, Trenge platforms enable insurers to make predictive risk and fraud analyzes and make data-based decisions, and data security is maintained by complying with central insurance regulations.', 'Mehrane Al-Rani Pari Khodadadi, Industry Management Group and Maryam Mohammad Rafizadeh, Dana Insurance Mines', NULL, 'Creative digital products and software export. The company is knowledge-based'),
  ('فناوری ارتباطات نوری دانیال موج', 'danialmoj.com', NULL, 'Daniel Moj optical communication technology', 'This collection deals with research, development, design and implementation of advanced systems in various industries such as petrochemicals, ports, transportation, building energy and hospitals in the fields of telecommunications, electronics, Internet of Things and intelligence. It also provides technical services, engineering, intelligent monitoring, energy optimization, and full support for industrial and infrastructure projects.', 'Danial Moj Foundation Knowledge Holding is one of the country''s technology leaders in the fields of telecommunications, data centers, command systems and security operations, relying on the power of internal research, development and production. Using artificial intelligence and intelligent systems, this company provides comprehensive solutions for critical and infrastructure industries. Its field of activity includes the development of safety and security systems, machine vision, native Internet of Things, digital twin, and intelligent energy and fleet management. Daniel Moj products and services are used in domestic projects and neighboring countries. By focusing on innovation and self-sufficiency, this holding has a significant contribution in advancing the economy, knowledge base and improving the advanced infrastructure of the country.', 'Samad Samadiani', NULL, 'Optical communication equipment and networks. The company is knowledge-based'),
  ('فناوری اطالعات و ارتباطات تسنیم', 'tict.ir', 'info@tict.ir', 'Tasnim information and communication technology', 'BMS is a producer of integrated solutions for access control, image processing and', 'With the aim of producing and providing a variety of 1379 knowledge-based information and communication technology companies, Tasnim has started working comprehensive solutions for human capital management and access control to organizations and industries in the country. As a technological and innovative company in the field of design and production of integrated systems in the form of software, hardware, electronic and mechanical units, Tasnim is operating as one of the first level companies in the country.', 'Maysam Seyedreza Zaribaf, Ali Hamzezadeh', NULL, 'Communication and information technology services. The company is knowledge-based'),
