  ('فنون داده پروری بسامد', NULL, NULL, 'Frequency data processing techniques', 'Electronics and telecommunications', ', was established. The founders of Basamed Data Processing Engineering Company in 1385 graduated from Amirkabir University of Technology with degrees in electronic engineering and medical engineering. Over the past years, this company has provided various activities in the field of design, manufacture and production of electronic, telecommunication and signal processing systems according to the technical needs of customers. Most of the activities carried out have focused on the use of young and expert forces and the localization of new technologies in accordance with the national and domestic needs of the country. A significant part of the products produced in this company were designed and manufactured for the first time in the country', 'Farzad Falhi', 'Data processing and signal analysis of all introduced products have approval Knowledge is the basis of innovation', NULL),
