  ('کنترل پردازنده', 'controlpardazandeh.com', 'info@controlpardazandeh.com', 'Processor control', 'Designing, consulting and implementing automation, telemetry and SCADA systems, manufacturing controllers, modems and data collection modules in industrial fields and providing operational technology solutions', 'Designing, consulting and implementation of telemetry and SCADA projects in infrastructure industries such as water and electricity based on internationally recognized equipment is one of the main areas of activity of this group. Also, PLC, Soft Logic PLC, IPC, design, engineering and implementation of industrial automation projects based on microcontrollers, as well as design and manufacture of boards and electronic systems and equipment required for the implementation of 34 automation systems are carried out in this complex. With 1396 industrial automation projects, this company succeeded in receiving the license of knowledge-based companies in January and has a technical and engineering license from the Ministry of Industry, Mines and Trade. Also, membership in (Khorasan Razavi Province Computer Trade Union, Khorasan Branch of Electrical and Electronics Engineers Association) and having a certificate of competence from the Management and Planning Organization is a support for the technical and operational validity of this collection.', 'Hassan Javaindeh, Mohammad Hossein Izadi', 'RTU monitoring system Analyzer of electrical parameters of industrial modem PC Plug in board DAQ Analog/Digital', 'Design of control and automation systems'),
  ('گرین وب سامانه نوین', 'greenweb.ir', 'info@greenweb.ir', 'greenweb', 'Activities in all computer fields including consulting, supervision, design, production, distribution, installation and support of software systems, hardware and computer networks, as well as design and production of goods in the field of superior technologies with high added value and related software production', 'Sal Experience is one of the pioneers of digital transformation and intelligentization in the country with more than 30 green webs and operates in the fields of artificial intelligence, Internet of Things, blockchain, cloud services, web hosting and cyber security. This company supports private businesses and various industries and has an active presence in the international arena. Green Web, as an information technology export agent, accompanies knowledge-based companies in entering global markets. This collection has won the title of "the only exporter of the national example of the information technology industry". Also, Green Web is the first artificial intelligence and cloud infrastructure company in Iran, which is accepted in the capital market and paves the way for the digital transformation of the country''s large industries.', 'Seyed Hassan Hashemi, Mehdi Mohammadi', 'Graphic processing cloud platform', 'Web hosting services, data centers, cloud computing'),
