  ('مانا اندیشه ستاره خاوران', 'manaandisheh.com', 'manandisheh@gmail.com', 'The meaning of the thought of Star of the East', 'Smartening the public transport fleet', 'Mana Andishe Setare Khavaran company focuses on the development of indigenous technologies in the field of intelligent urban transportation systems (ITS) in order to improve the efficiency of public fleet management in the country. With the mission of designing and producing local hardware and software solutions, this company seeks to increase transparency, reduce operational costs and improve the quality of urban services. Mana''s vision is to become a national authority in the design and production of intelligent fleet systems and secure communication equipment in the country.', 'Morteza Zarin Darfesh, Mohammad Taghi Mozafari, Hamira Nikro', 'Intelligent system of public transport fleet OneFold workflow and project management system', 'Technology consulting, smart solutions'),
