  ('موج آینده فرافن', 'farafan.ir', 'info@farafan.ir', 'farafan', 'Information and telecommunication technology, new communication and digital technologies Necton 5G desktop modem', 'With the aim of providing integration services in the field of technology, Moj Aindeh Farafan was established in the year of information and communication in 1389. The main approach of this company from the beginning has been to create a knowledge-based collection based on current knowledge and operational experiences. The future wave of Farafan has played an effective role in the telecommunication projects of the country by identifying the gap of system and service integrator companies. Due to the convergence of technologies in the world''s telecommunication industry, the importance of system integration has been more and more noticed. This company receives business needs as an intermediary link between operators and telecommunication service providers. Then, he designs and implements appropriate technical and executive management solutions', 'Mohammad Akhwan Karbasi, Fariborz Nejaddadger, Reza Ali Blandi, Reza Soleimani Dalrustaghi, Vahid Nobahar', NULL, NULL),
  ('نرم افزاری امن پرداز', 'amnpardaz.com', 'info@amnpardaz.com', 'Security software', 'Consulting- 3. Provision of information security services- 2. Software development- 1', 'And it has started its activity in an academic environment in 1383 Amon Pardaz software company. The most important goals of its founders are to achieve the knowledge of producing world-class products in the information technology industry and to create a reliable brand at the global level. We believe that software is an ever-increasing need in today''s world and its security is inevitable, so we decided to build software that would establish security in the field of information technology and cyber space. Research and development has always been a major part of this company''s activities and it spends a significant percentage of its annual profit on this.', 'Abbas Hosseini, Farid Khalili Rad, Sajjad Nafisi', 'No knowledge-based product', 'Information security software, encryption, management access'),
  ('نور بهینه گستر خاورمیانه', 'nbgme.com', 'info@nbgme.net', 'Optimizing light of the Middle East', 'Manufacturer of passive fiber optic equipment', 'With the goal of national self-sufficiency in the field of 2013, Noor Optimum Gostar Middle East Company has started its activity since the year of passive telecommunication equipment. This company specializes in the design and production of telecommunication equipment, and for the first time in Iran, it has launched an industrial production line for optical fiber interfaces. Middle East Optimum Gostar is considered the first manufacturer of microduct with silicone coating in the country. The main focus of the company is on maintaining quality at the level of global standards, reducing dependence and effective presence in international markets. Customer orientation. Continuous improvement of quality and adherence to commitments are among the basic principles of this collection', 'Amirhossein Aslani, Ali Aslani, Hossein Menafi Varkiani, Majid Menafi Varkiani, Nasrin Sedkianizadeh', 'Tactical patch cord and optical fiber microduct', 'Smart lighting systems, energy optimization'),
  ('نسیم فدک ایرانیان', 'nasimfadak.com', 'info@nasimfadak.com', 'Nasim Fadak Iranians', 'Electronics, telecommunications and avionics', 'With the aim of producing, repairing and exporting high-tech products, this company was established in 2014 in the field of electronics, telecommunications and avionics. This company is the first manufacturer of quick access to flight information (in the region) and the Quick Access Recorder (QAR) is the third manufacturer in the world. The research to upgrade the product and its wireless production has been completed 90% successfully and the Wireless Quick Access Recorder (WQAR) has been started. We hope that the final product will be released to the market before the end of this year. .', 'Asghar Dabiri Reza Sobhanipour, Rasul Mohammadi Ali Yadmalt', 'No knowledge-based product', 'Technology services and software support'),
  ('ونداد ویرا هومان', 'parspack.com', 'info@parspack.com', 'Vandad Vira Homan', 'Cloud services', 'Vandad Vira Human Technology Company is one of the leading companies in the field of cloud services in Iran. This company started its activity with a focus on providing quality, stable and scalable cloud infrastructure in 1397, and its main focus is on serving startups, small businesses (small businesses) and large organizations, and so far it has hosted thousands of websites, applications and SME (and medium) online services.', 'Mohammad Abdi, Mohammad Samimi Rad', 'No knowledge-based product', 'Enterprise and customized software'),
  ('همیان فن', 'Hamianfan.com', 'info@hamianfan.com', 'Hamian fan', 'Designer and manufacturer of protective relays', 'Hemian Fan Pishgam Company, a pioneer in Iran''s electricity industry, with a commitment to innovation, quality and sustainability of electrical infrastructure, designs and produces digital protective relays and advanced electrical panels, 2013, which redefine the standards of the electrical industry. Since its establishment in 2011, the company''s goal has been to provide safe and efficient solutions for electrical infrastructure. Hamian, Fan, as a knowledge-based company, has an effective presence in national and international projects by using new technologies and a team of experts, and is known as a reliable partner. With more than three decades of experience, this company is committed to creating a sustainable future for the electrical industry and by investing in research and development and providing superior quality products, it has established its position as one of the pioneers in the region.', 'Ali Akbar Soheili, Mohammad Reza Asalami, Mohammad Kazem Yazdan, Genah Ali Moslehi, Fatane Fatuhi Zavareh, Mohammad Hadi, Yazdan Panah, Jafar Rabiei', 'No knowledge-based product', 'Technology engineering and innovation services'),
  ('هوشمند سازان بیتا', 'hsbco.ir', 'Info@hsbco.ir', 'hsbco', 'Consultancy, designer, manufacturer and implementer of comprehensive traffic control systems', 'years of continuous activity in the field of electronic protection with the approach of 25 smart companies, Sazan Beta, with research and development and production of protection and security products, is now one of the dynamic and active companies in providing comprehensive organizational traffic control solutions from design and production to implementation and training in large-scale projects of oil and gas and petrochemical industries, metals and mines, government organizations and bodies, universities and educational centers and private companies in the country.', 'Iraj Yaqoubi Kia, Saeed Yaqoubi Kia, Mohammad Reza Yaqoubi Kia', 'No knowledge-based product', 'IoT, smart solutions and')
)
UPDATE exhibition_companies AS c SET
  name_en = COALESCE(t.name_en, c.name_en), tagline_en = t.tagline_en,
  description_en = t.intro_en, intro_en = t.intro_en, founders_en = t.founders_en,
  knowledge_products_intro_en = t.knowledge_en, export_potential_en = t.export_en
FROM translations AS t
WHERE c.name = t.company_name
   OR (t.email IS NOT NULL AND lower(c.email) = lower(t.email))
   OR (t.website IS NOT NULL AND lower(regexp_replace(c.website, '^https?://(www\.)?', '')) = lower(regexp_replace(t.website, '^https?://(www\.)?', '')));

