  ('پگاه آفتاب', 'Pegaheaftab.com', 'info@pegaheaftab.com', 'مدیریت نگهداشت دارایی های فیزیکی', 'Management of maintenance of physical assets', 'For 1379 Pegah Aftab maintenance and repair software, which was developed since the year of power plants, is known today as a comprehensive solution for managing the maintenance of physical assets in various industries. This system with high development and customization capabilities, compatible with ISO14224 and supporting IAM and UpTime standards, helps with models to optimize maintenance processes and increase the efficiency of assets.'),
  ('پگاه آفتاب', 'Pegaheaftab.com', 'info@pegaheaftab.com', 'مدیریت الگ شیت ها و چک لیست ها', 'Management of log sheets and checklists', 'In equipment-oriented industries such as power plants, refineries, and petrochemicals, continuous monitoring of equipment is very important, and manual log sheet recording methods have serious limitations. Pegah Aftab Algsheet software with application, process management and online and offline Android NFC voice conversion, technology to text based on artificial intelligence, mechanizes the recording and reporting of parameters. This integrated platform enables efficient and cost-effective operational utilization, data analysis and predictive maintenance.'),
  ('پگاه آفتاب', 'Pegaheaftab.com', 'info@pegaheaftab.com', 'مدیریت قطعات یدکی و مواد مصرفی', 'Management of spare parts and consumables', 'This software, along with consulting and executive support services, facilitates the management of spare parts and materials in equipment-oriented industries. By classifying, identifying, coding and tracking parts in warehouses and recording information in the ID card of equipment and maintenance processes, accurate and centralized management is provided. By preventing duplication or incomplete registration of goods, the system makes the management of parts and consumables transparent, targeted and efficient.'),
  ('پگاه آفتاب', 'Pegaheaftab.com', 'info@pegaheaftab.com', 'سیستم ساز فرایندی', 'Process system builder', 'Pegah Aftab''s "process system builder" allows business experts to design and implement the organizational software they need without complexity. This platform includes defining data, designing forms and mobile interface, managing workflow, applying rules and creating reports and dashboards. System Builder is a process for developing simple to critical software with thousands of users in various industries'),
  ('پیام گستر فاوا', 'karasite.ir', 'info@payamgostar.ir', 'نرم افزار جامع حراست و انتظامات دژبان سیستم جامع پالک خوان دژبان', 'Dezhban comprehensive security and regulation software, comprehensive Dezhban license plate reader system', 'Dezhban''s license plate reader system controls the traffic of cars in parking lots with artificial intelligence and neural networks. The cameras record and process the license plates of the cars and its information is stored in the data bank. If allowed, the barricade will open automatically'),
  ('پیام گستر فاوا', 'karasite.ir', 'info@payamgostar.ir', 'نرم افزار پخش مویرگی کارا', 'Capillary broadcast software', 'The capillary distribution software provides the possibility of grouping customers, setting different prices and managing orders with regulatory approval. This system supports the management of visitors, supervisors, distributors and drivers with dynamic commissions. Accurate four-level accounting, check and invoice registration, customer control and various reporting are among its other capabilities'),
  ('پیام گستر فاوا', 'karasite.ir', 'info@payamgostar.ir', 'نرم افزار صندوق فروش رستورانی سامان مبتنی بر کارتخوان های اندرویدی', 'Saman restaurant cash register software based on Android card readers', 'This Android software is installed on smart card readers and provides cafe and restaurant cash management by registering orders, issuing invoices and in-app payments. It is a low-cost and fast product for businesses without complete computer equipment, and with the integration of payment, it makes full management of the fund possible. This system includes the reception of clients with recognition and facial RFID, personnel and goods traffic registration, weighing scales and modules. It provides the possibility of exchanging messages and complete monitoring.'),
  ('پیام گستر فاوا', 'karasite.ir', 'info@payamgostar.ir', 'سامانه یکپارچه مدیریت کافه و رستوران سامان', 'Saman cafe and restaurant integrated management system', 'Saman is a comprehensive restaurant management system that goes from order to . CRM covers delivery, hall management, warehouse, raw materials, and this system reduces errors and increases service speed with real-time inventory control, order registration, invoice printing, and profit analysis.'),
  ('پیام گستر فاوا', 'karasite.ir', 'info@payamgostar.ir', 'گیت کنترل تردد دژبان', 'Dezhban traffic control gate', 'The Dehban traffic control gate controls the entry and exit of people in organizations and public places. This glass gate with a steel body is suitable for offices, metro and CE scratch resistant, resistant and standard design, public centers.'),
  ('پیشگامان فرا رسانه سروش', 'nitechpark.com', 'Info@nitechpark.com', 'شادیانه / خانواده امن', 'Happy / safe family', 'The "Shadianeh / Safe Family" product is a smart web application to create a safe, educational and creative environment for children in the digital space. With the possibility of monitoring the child''s activities and providing analytical reports, this system provides indirect parental supervision. Shadiane''s localized artificial intelligence assistant, suitable for the age of the child and Islamic, deals with education, accountability and production of creative content-Iranian culture. With the combination of artificial intelligence, native content and parental control, Shadianeh is a healthy alternative to foreign examples and a suitable platform for children''s digital growth.'),
  ('پیشگامان فرا رسانه سروش', 'nitechpark.com', 'Info@nitechpark.com', 'انیمیت فری', 'Animate Free', 'The "Animate Free" product is an animation and entertainment production application that simplifies the process of creating animation and simultaneous voiceover. This application provides users with the possibility of producing animated content without the need for technical expertise or expensive equipment. Animate Free has created a platform for the creation of innovative content and the flourishing of talents in the field of dubbing and animation. This product is available in the form of thousands of installations, it is ready to enter the market with 100 trials and more than'),
  ('پیشگامان فرا رسانه سروش', 'nitechpark.com', 'Info@nitechpark.com', '! سامانه چهار ، سه ، دو ، یک', '! Four, three, two, one system', '"An intelligent education, competition and entertainment platform 4321" is a system that is presented in the form of an online site and application and deals with the management of users'' entertainment time with an educational approach. This system provides education and entertainment at the same time by using scoring, competition, lottery and festivals including 4321. The system has various sections with multimedia educational content, it also provides a suitable platform for organizations and businesses for advertising, education and targeted communication with audiences.'),
  ('ترسیم داده افزار', 'tarsimdade.com', 'tarsimdadeh@gmail.com', 'نرم افزار جامع یکپارچه دانش بنیان مدیریت صنعتی ترسیم سیستم', 'Integrated comprehensive knowledge base software for industrial management drawing system', 'Drawing the system, the main product of the drawing software company, is a comprehensive, integrated and modular software that brings organizations to operational maturity by using a team specialized in the development and analysis of industrial systems. This system includes eight main modules, including management (CMMS), EAM (physical asset) maintenance and repair management, health, safety and environment management (RMS), risk management (LMS), virtual training (PSM), process safety management (HSE), and risk-based inspection management (DCC). In addition to the main modules, system mapping has RBI (advanced subsystems that provide management, analytical and intelligent capabilities to the organization. This integrated and flexible structure provides the possibility of customization, localization and independent and integrated use of each module, and its purpose is to increase productivity, optimize resources and reduce the organization''s operating costs. System mapping, as a comprehensive and integrated industrial software solution, helps organizations in the complete management of processes, resources, data, and decision-making capabilities. It offers outstanding technical and functional capabilities. These capabilities include complete integration between modules and subsystems, modularity and the possibility of independent use of each module, the ability to customize and localize according to the needs (with the design of complete BPMS data flow, support for multi-tenancy, process management and advanced workflow) for data-oriented decision-making, integration of large data and 3DMS and BI (dynamics, business intelligence and data analysis, advanced processing, complete security facilities and access control in The level of modules and subsystems, management of technical documents and documents with the possibility of versioning and controlled access, a powerful search engine and intelligent report generator, support for artificial intelligence, for data analysis and forecasting trends, flexibility in displaying fields and information headers in different stages of the workflow. The control of the effectiveness of modules and subsystems is dynamic and the possibility of integration with external systems and data processing.'),
  ('ترسیم داده افزار', 'tarsimdade.com', 'tarsimdadeh@gmail.com', 'X_Stone خط تولید نرم افزاری', 'X_Stone software production line', 'As a knowledge-based software production line, X-Stone provides a fast and optimal solution for large-scale software development and provides an integrated platform for creating high-level products by using the latest methods and technologies. This platform, service-oriented architecture with Model-Driven Development methodology implemented and with Java/JEE (and SOA programming language) provides the possibility of connecting to all ORM databases. This infrastructure increases the productivity of the organization by reducing the cost of software production and maintenance, reducing the need for manpower, reducing project time and facilitating the training of newcomers. System design as independent subsystems, scalability with support for high X-Stone numbers and flexibility in facing the domain It guarantees unlimited users and high volume of data, accelerates development with code generator, and increases efficiency and speed of operation. This platform provides a high level of information security with strong encryption, individual and group access management, and the possibility of producing diverse modules without dependence on an external team. Simple and integrated user interface It reduces the learning time and increases the speed of using the system. The service-oriented architecture has turned the powerful database into X-Stone, and the possibility of operating in the multi-tenant cloud environment, the ability of enterprise scale, web service support, and an advanced, flexible and reliable infrastructure for the development of complex software.'),
  ('توسعه تکنولوژی آموزشی دانش آوران خراسان', 'daneshavaran.ir', 'info@daneshavaran.ir', 'برد هوشمند پارس', 'Pars smart board', 'The new generation smart board is an advanced replacement for traditional boards that enables dynamic and collaborative learning with a large touch surface and precise sensors. This system has the ability to connect to a computer and video projector, simultaneous management of content and multi-user interaction. Board''s dedicated software provides the possibility of recording sessions and storing writings. With durable design, easy installation and various sizes, these boards help to improve the quality of education in schools, universities and organizations.'),
  ('توسعه تکنولوژی آموزشی دانش آوران خراسان', 'daneshavaran.ir', 'info@daneshavaran.ir', 'کیوسک و استند لمسی دانش آوران', 'Kiosk and touch stand for academics', 'Interactive kiosks are smart systems that provide services such as 24-hour registration guidance, payment and receiving feedback automatically and hourly with a display, touch screen, internal computer and specialized software. These kiosks have a durable industrial design and high-quality displays, and can be equipped with card readers, barcode readers, and cash printers, and are used in public and institutional spaces. The software and hardware of the kiosks can be customized. These features increase service speed, reduce costs and improve customer experience'),
  ('توسعه تکنولوژی آموزشی دانش آوران خراسان', 'daneshavaran.ir', 'info@daneshavaran.ir', 'نمایشگر لمسی کاراکو', 'Caraco touch screen', 'Touch screens of the new generation are interactive tools that provide the possibility of writing, drawing and moving content with precise touch and supporting multiple users at the same time, and are considered a smart replacement for traditional equipment. These screens with industrial panel, high image quality and long durability, are suitable for classrooms, meeting rooms and exhibition centers. They have the ability to connect to the computer, network and peripheral equipment, and the possibility of customization in size and application is available. These features increase the quality of communication, the speed of decision-making, and the user experience.'),
  ('توسعه زیر ساخت های فناوری اطالعات سیگما', 'sigma.ir', 'dm@sigma.ir', 'ابر عمومی سیگما', 'Sigma Public Cloud', '), cloud space for storage (IaaS), Sigma''s public cloud is a comprehensive set of cloud services that includes cloud server (LBaaS), cloud load balancer DNSaaS (cloud DNS), CDN service, cloud content distribution network Cloud Storage (information), cloud Kubernetes cluster Cloud Backup (cloud backup), cloud WAF (cloud backup), cloud web security service FWaaS (cloud firewall). This Marketplace (as well as the API and YAML cloud marketplace) (in cooperation with Fava Park, KaaS-based cloud automation). The collection of services provides a secure, scalable and integrated cloud infrastructure for organizations and businesses.'),
  ('توسعه زیر ساخت های فناوری اطالعات سیگما', 'sigma.ir', 'dm@sigma.ir', 'پورتال سازمانی و خدمات الکترونیکی', 'Enterprise portal and electronic services', 'Sigma''s corporate portal and electronic services include an integrated set of subsystems that allow organizations to fully manage content and digital processes (CMS subsystem). This portal has a content management subsystem (including form builder, workflow and report builder), integration subsystem with organizational systems, Application Builder (program builder). This integrated structure, AI platform and E-Shop artificial intelligence subsystem, EAI electronic store subsystem, provides a suitable for providing digital services, automating processes and intelligent data analysis in organizations.'),
  ('توسعه سامانه های آرتیان توس', 'artianhpc.ir', 'info@artianhpc.ir', 'سرور بومی ارتیان', 'Ertian native server', 'According to the complex requirements of modern infrastructure, new native servers are designed with modular architecture and quadruple processing power, which simultaneously support the implementation of service-oriented architecture, the execution of general-purpose software, the hosting of large-scale virtual machines, and the storage of large data.'),
  ('توسعه سامانه های آرتیان توس', 'artianhpc.ir', 'info@artianhpc.ir', 'اکسس پوینت آرتیان', 'Artian access point', 'Danesh Banyan Artian company has designed and produced a completely native Wi-Fi access point using the power of internal experts, which manages the network to connect devices. This product with a special price, SBC is one third of external samples and the computing core can be used as a high-speed access point and a processing node. The open source middleware guarantees high security and control, and internal after-sales service has made this access point a cost-effective and reliable option for sensitive and organizational networks.'),
  ('توسعه سامانه های آرتیان توس', 'artianhpc.ir', 'info@artianhpc.ir', 'تین کالینت آرتیان', 'Tin Caliente Artian', 'Today, Thin Client is a new generation of personal computers, known as widely used in leading organizations as a replacement for conventional personal computers. By using advanced hardware technologies and modern architectures, these devices have much smaller dimensions and at the same time provide high efficiency and processing power, while they have a much lower cost than traditional computers.'),
  ('توسعه سامانه های رایانه سماتوس', 'samatoos.ir', 'Info@samatoos.ir', 'سازمان الکترونیک تحت وب پیوند', 'Electronic organization under the link web', '"Link" electronic organization is a comprehensive and integrated system for mechanizing the circulation of correspondence and archiving the organization''s documents. It is independent of the LAMP platform. This system is based on the open source technology of the "Piond" electronic organization and includes subsystems of correspondence circulation, form generator, form circulation, report generator and document archive. In order to facilitate the work of the organization''s users (especially senior managers), a mobile version of the correspondence system has also been produced. By using this system, users will be able to check their administrative letters through mobile phones in any part of the world and apply the necessary commands. By using the "Piond" electronic organization, there is no longer a need to maintain a large amount of paper, and many lengthy processes can be corrected and improved with proper management. By using the form maker system, many common and customary forms in organizations, such as leave and mission forms, can be designed and implemented according to the opinion of the organization''s system leader, and by defining the related circulation process in the organization, through the correspondence circulation system, it can be made to flow and automate.'),
  ('توسعه فناوری لوتوس شبکه', 'Lotusnet.ir', 'info@lotusnet.ir', ')ATS(دستگاه سویچینگ انتقال خودکار برق', '(ATS) automatic power transmission switching device', '(Lotus, an advanced solution for providing stable and uninterrupted power in data centers) ATS is an automatic power transfer switching device for organizations and critical infrastructures. This system automatically switches the source and generator with intelligent detection of power outages or fluctuations and prevents damage to sensitive equipment. The function of sources is Source Priority (Power Topology), intelligent prioritization of the power supply. In addition, Voltage Protection System () and multi-layer voltage and current protection system are provided, and standard modular and rack mount design, SNMP and RS-232 installation, USB monitoring and status reporting through (Made in Iran) and easy maintenance are possible. This product is completely indigenous and manufactured in Iran.'),
  ('توسعه فناوری لوتوس شبکه', 'Lotusnet.ir', 'info@lotusnet.ir', ')CDN( شبکه توزیع محتوای دیجیتال اینترنت', '(CDN) Internet digital content distribution network', 'A digital content distribution network is a collection of geographically distributed servers that increase the speed of delivery of web content by bringing web content closer to where users are. Data centers around the world use caching, a process that temporarily stores copies of files so that you can access cached content such as web pages, images, and CDNs through a server near you. Internet access from a web-enabled device or browser. Videos are stored on proxy servers close to your physical location. This allows you to do things like watch movies, download software, check your bank balance, post on social media or shop without waiting for content to load.'),
  ('تولیدی و مهندسی ایده آل مهدبان', 'mahdban.com', 'mahdavifar@mahdban.com', 'سیستم پایش شرایط محیطی مدل آرند', 'Arend model environmental conditions monitoring system', '(As the central part of Arand) the environmental condition monitoring system of the system receives data from various sensors, analyzes it and makes decisions based on it, with variations in appearance from L6 to L1. This system is designed at the levels of the number of sensors and relays and can be used with high flexibility, according to the needs, conditions and budget of customers.'),
  ('تولیدی و مهندسی ایده آل مهدبان', 'mahdban.com', 'mahdavifar@mahdban.com', 'سیستم کنترل تردد مدل بیدار', 'Bedar model traffic control system', '"Bidar" traffic control system is designed to increase access security in organizations and offices. This system is two pieces; The command section is out of the reach of clients and there is only one visible and usable box at the entrance, which minimizes the possibility of intrusion or unauthorized hacking.'),
  ('تولیدی و مهندسی ایده آل مهدبان', 'mahdban.com', 'mahdavifar@mahdban.com', 'IP GSM-Alarm سیستم', 'IP GSM-Alarm system', 'This module sends visual and audio alarms, text messages and calls to the LCD during environmental disturbances and displays the source of the problem on the screen. The data is transferred to the broker through the SIM card and if the antenna is weak, the connection is provided through the local network so that the data transfer is safe and secure.'),
  ('تولیدی و مهندسی ایده آل مهدبان', 'mahdban.com', 'mahdavifar@mahdban.com', 'سیستم دمابان', 'Damaban system', 'This system monitors and records the temperature of sensitive medical products such as medicine, vaccine, and blood, and by installing it on special refrigerators, it maintains the temperature within the allowed range by controlling the compressor or heater. In case of malfunction, the operator is notified to prevent further damage.'),
  ('تولیدی و مهندسی ایده آل مهدبان', 'mahdban.com', 'mahdavifar@mahdban.com', 'سیستم آالرم باکس', 'Alarm box system', 'The new generation of digital alarm boxes of Ideal Mahdban Company is an integrated and efficient replacement for traditional systems in the telecommunication halls of power plants and industrial centers, which is compatible with different relays and voltages and reports errors and situations digitally.'),
  ('تولیدی و مهندسی ایده آل مهدبان', 'mahdban.com', 'mahdavifar@mahdban.com', 'HMI سیستم', 'HMI system', 'For monitoring and control via HMI, Ideal Mehdban has designed a remote system for telecommunication centers, industrial centers and server rooms to monitor environmental parameters such as temperature, humidity, voltage, current, dust and the status of sensors such as smoke, water leakage, power outages and doors, and if they go out of the desired range, the operators'),
  ('تولیدی و مهندسی ایده آل مهدبان', 'mahdban.com', 'mahdavifar@mahdban.com', '.به موقع اطالع رسانی کند49', 'Notify on time 49', NULL),
  ('تیم یار', 'teamyar.com', 'info@teamyar.com', 'راهکار ثمر: راهکار مدیریت تولید', 'Samar solution: production management solution', 'Timyar''s "Thamar" software is an integrated BOM intelligent production management system that mechanizes all production stages and increases productivity and reduces errors with capabilities such as This MRP and Timyar software provides the possibility of complete monitoring of production and ERP by connecting to other cost modules and helps to make more accurate decisions and better control.'),
  ('تیم یار', 'teamyar.com', 'info@teamyar.com', 'راهکار اثر: راهکار مدیریت دورکاری', 'Effective solution: Remote work management solution', 'Timyar''s "Effect" software is an integrated system for managing activities, projects (tasks, documents and organizational communications) including remote work and employee presence. This secure and centralized web-based software, by connecting to other modules of Timyar, increases transparency, reduces scattered tools, and helps to make more accurate management decisions and increase productivity.'),
  ('تیم یار', 'teamyar.com', 'info@teamyar.com', 'راهکار دید: راهکار مدیریت یکپارچه سازمان', 'Vision solution: Integrated management solution of the organization', 'For Timyar''s "DID" ERP, it is an integrated content management system under corporate websites. By removing intermediaries, it provides easy, secure, ERP and agile management of the website and by connecting to other modules, it helps to reduce costs and improve customer communication.'),
  ('تیم یار', 'teamyar.com', 'info@teamyar.com', 'راهکار بها: راهکار محاسبه بهای تمام شده', 'Price solution: the solution for calculating the final price', 'Timyar''s cost solution calculates production and commercial costs in an accurate and integrated manner. By collecting information from different departments, the possibility of cost analysis, profitability and pricing is provided by Timyar, which causes financial transparency, cost control and ERP. The connection becomes more accurate'),
  ('تیم یار', 'teamyar.com', 'info@teamyar.com', 'راهکار دانا: راهکار مدیریت دانش', 'Knowledgeable solution: knowledge management solution', 'Timyar''s knowledge management solution identifies, collects, stores and shares organizational knowledge in an integrated manner. With various tools, this system manages valuable information in a structured and secure manner, and turns it into a usable asset for the entire organization. As a result, access to information, customer and employee experience, and accuracy of decision making'),
  ('تیم یار', 'teamyar.com', 'info@teamyar.com', '.بهبود می یابد51', 'It improves 51', NULL),
  ('خبره پرداز پارس', 'kpp.ir', 'info@kpp.ir', 'بانکداری شرکتی', 'Corporate banking', 'Corporate banking is a business model, a large, complex and systematic strategy that tries to answer all the needs of large corporate customers whose banking needs are very different from other customer segments by using different structures, models and processes from other bank customers: The integrated solution of corporate banking has the following main subsystems: monitoring and management of the business intelligence system model from the bank''s perspective, the customer management portal, the user system: the customer management portal is a system. which is provided to the users of the bank headquarters and is used for management, communication, monitoring and reporting from/with the corporate banking system: The customer system is a system that is provided to corporate customers to receive transactional and commercial services and to view and use reports related to corporate banking. The distinguishing feature of the corporate banking solution is to provide electronic signature of documents using the client''s hardware token in the corporate banking user system: the business intelligence system from the bank''s perspective is a system for receiving large and managerial reports, in order to monitor the performance of customers, categorize and evaluate them by defined reports and specify roles based on access levels in the bank.'),
  ('خبره پرداز پارس', 'kpp.ir', 'info@kpp.ir', 'باشگاه وفاداری مشتریان بوم', 'Boom Customer Loyalty Club', 'Customer clubs are an effective strategy for organizations that want to increase customer loyalty and build long-term relationships with them. As a portal to create and repeat interaction, the customer club provides opportunities to exchange information between customers and the organization. Through the club, organizations can create a close relationship with customers in all related activities. Bom Customer Loyalty Club system of Pars Connoisseur Company is a platform for creating loyalty program(s) according to the developing and changing needs of economic enterprises. Creating a sense and motivation of loyalty among the customers of a business depends on various factors. The efforts of business executives in implementing a detailed and regular plan for each of these factors will lead to business prosperity. The customer club system is a place to implement customer loyalty programs through interaction, more accurate identification of customers and their needs and interests. Each loyalty program may be different according to the type of business, the type of audience, and the operational conditions, and may have its own appeal for the audience.'),
  ('خوارزم ارتباط خاورمیانه', 'algocom.net', 'sales@algocom.net', ') مبتنی برLEO/MEO) LEO Tracker سامانه ردیابی ماهواره های مدار X/Y فناوری ) آنتن اتوماتیک ماهواره ای قابل حمل (ایستگاه زمینی ماهواره ای', '(based on LEO/MEO) LEO Tracker tracking system for X/Y orbit satellites technology (portable automatic satellite antenna) (satellite ground station)', 'Khorezm Middle East Communication Company has engineered its satellite tracking systems with precision MEO (Medium Earth Orbit LEO) near the Earth (High Throughput) to provide stable and efficient communications with satellite constellations in these orbits. As a leading company in the design and production of these systems in the country, the company has been Tilted Az/Az/El, X/Y. These automatic and portable antennas are made with a precise design for easy transportation and quick setup in sensitive missions, and the Azimuth-Elevation pedestal axes of these systems occupy the least possible space with flexible side technology. Also, the use of foldable carbon fiber reflectors up to the diameter of 4.5 meters ensures the reliability of the device in various operating conditions.'),
  ('خوارزم ارتباط خاورمیانه', 'algocom.net', 'sales@algocom.net', ') مبتنی برLEO/MEO) LEO Tracker سامانه ردیابی ماهواره های مدار Az/El فناوری', ') based on LEO/MEO) LEO Tracker satellite tracking system for Az/El technology', '2000 to 160 km (Low Earth Orbit), which orbits at LEO altitude, is widely used for satellites. The satellites of this orbit go around the earth at high speed and need tracker ground stations in two LEO trackers with the ability to follow their path. The cheaper Az/El system provides the same capability as the XY model and the Az/El model, but does not cover the zenith region.'),
  ('خوارزم ارتباط خاورمیانه', 'algocom.net', 'sales@algocom.net', ')MSAT( )آنتن اتوماتیک ماهواره ای خودرویی (خودگشا', '(MSAT) (Automatic Car Satellite Antenna)', 'It is an automatic satellite antenna that is installed on MSAT, a knowledge-based car product, and after stopping, it automatically finds and adjusts the desired satellite. This antenna has the ability to be manually and automatically adjusted to (RaKa to L) (in different GEO frequency bands) of fixed orbit satellites and provides two-way Internet, voice, image and data services through satellite. Its software is custom-made based on the satellite modem model and its main features are intelligence, high reliability, low support cost and easy installation.'),
  ('خوارزم ارتباط خاورمیانه', 'algocom.net', 'sales@algocom.net', ')AFSAT( ) آنتن اتوماتیک ماهواره ای استقراری (ایستگاه زمینی ماهواره ای', '(AFSAT) automatic satellite antenna (satellite ground station).', 'This knowledge-based product is a fully automatic satellite deployment antenna that is installed on existing bases and is used for satellite ground stations. It is controlled from the hub center and after the initial setup, there is no need to refer the operator for the next settings (direct connection with the NMS antenna controller) is established with the network management software and it is possible to make all technical changes remotely.'),
  ('راهبر نیروی خراسان (رانیر)', 'Ranirco.com', 'info@ranirco.com', ')سیستم جامع خدمات مشترکین برق (ناب پالس', '(Comprehensive service system for electricity subscribers (Nab Pulse', 'By automating repetitive tasks and reducing human errors, process management engines reduce the time of doing tasks and increase the productivity of the organization. These engines provide the possibility of monitoring the work flow and different stages of the processes and allow managers to see the performance and status of the processes in real time. Changing and updating processes is possible without recoding; This feature makes the software to be coordinated with organizational changes and current conditions faster. By using process management engines, communication between teams and different departments of the organization is facilitated and problems caused by lack of coordination are reduced. As a result, efficiency is increased, errors are reduced and operational costs are reduced; Also, the resources of the organization are used more optimally. Automating processes leads to the provision of higher quality services and faster response time, which ultimately increases the satisfaction of stakeholders, both organizational users and electricity subscribers, considering that the structure of customer service systems, including sales subsystems, after-sales services, energy branching, and related subcategories, have a process nature, and there is a close relationship between these processes. Also, in order to avoid the implementation of operations in a tasteful manner in different units of the organization, an integrated system is needed. It is felt based on the process, with the approach of mechanizing all processes in the field of services of electricity subscribers (citizens) and the goal of designing a system based on process principles, the upgraded version of the comprehensive system of subscriber services was implemented using the process management engine. This system, while eliminating the production of paper in the sales route of electricity distribution, makes it possible to provide after-sales services without the need to visit the applicant in person, and helps to improve the administrative health and improve the customer experience.'),
  ('راهبر نیروی خراسان (رانیر)', 'Ranirco.com', 'info@ranirco.com', 'سامانه فروش مستقیم تجهیزات اندازه گیری برق', 'Direct sales system of electricity measurement equipment', 'Femta web service is designed to manage the information of buyers of products and services. This web service was created in order to facilitate the process of buying and selling equipment and services in the electricity industry and provides the possibility of registering buyers'' information, sending purchase links, managing products and tracking orders.'),
  ('رهیاب فن آوا', 'rahyabtelecom.com', 'm.tajmiri@rahyabtelecom.com', 'سیستم پشتیبانی عملیات و مدیریت خدمات فن آوری اطالعات اروشا', 'Operation support system and management of Arusha information technology services', NULL),
  ('سرزمین هوشمند پاد', 'podium.ir', 'info@podium.ir', 'پادیومAPI بازارچه', 'Podium API Bazaar', NULL),
  ('ساتا-سالمت الکترونیکی تامین', 'satahealth.com', 'info@satahealth.com', ')HIS( سامانه جامع مدیریت اطالعات بیمارستانی ساتا', '(HIS) Comprehensive Hospital Information Management System', 'SATA is an integrated and intelligent solution based on the medical knowledge of the HIS system, which covers all the treatment, support and management processes of hospitals in a single hospital. This system, by using the latest 400 social security treatment center technologies, is now in more use and has improved the quality of services and management decision-making.'),
  ('ساتا-سالمت الکترونیکی تامین', 'satahealth.com', 'info@satahealth.com', ')سامانه رسیدگی به اسناد پزشکی بستری سازمان تأمین اجتماعی (رسا', '(The system for dealing with inpatient medical documents of the Social Security Organization (RESA', 'Rasa system is a strategic system in the field of treatment of the social security organization, which increases the accuracy, speed and transparency of the processes by electronicizing the handling of inpatient documents. This system has been upgraded in the year of gradual establishment and development of connection with national systems'),
  ('ساتا-سالمت الکترونیکی تامین', 'satahealth.com', 'info@satahealth.com', ')راهکار هوشمند یکپارچه الکترونیک (رهیا', '(Intelligent Integrated Electronics Solution) (Rahiya', 'Rahia software is a comprehensive system for electronic registration and management of visit information, pharmaceutical and paraclinical prescriptions of patients and sending them to basic insurances. This system can be used in all types of medical centers and with full coverage of prescription processes and medical procedures, it increases the accuracy, speed and quality of medical services.'),
  ('ساتا-سالمت الکترونیکی تامین', 'satahealth.com', 'info@satahealth.com', ')PHR( سامانه پرونده سالمت و مراقبت شخصی کارکنان )EHR( راه اندازی سامانه پرونده الکترونیک سالمت و مراقبت پزشکی )سامانه بهای تمام شده (بهتا', '(PHR) Employee Health and Personal Care Record System (EHR) Launching the Behta Electronic Health and Medical Care Record System (Cost Price System)', 'The health and personal care file system of Mobarake Steel employees is designed as an integrated and user-oriented platform with the aim of promoting health, empowering employees and developing a culture of self-care. This system helps to continuously monitor the health and improve the lifestyle of employees by managing health information by the users themselves, easy access to medical records and the possibility of controlling the confidentiality of data. This project is designed with the aim of creating an integrated electronic health infrastructure for employees and families of Fauld Mubarakeh and based on national standards. The system provides ISO13606 and HL7 international documents such as integrated health electronics and three specialized subsystems, an intelligent platform for managing organizational health and improving employee health. Behta cost software is designed to mechanize the process of calculating the cost of goods and services. In this regard, users can mechanize the process of calculating the cost of different units after going through the initial stages of setting up the software, including: defining basic information, activities, cost centers, the basics of sharing, and receive the reports they need regarding various cases.'),
  ('شبکه افزار', 'shabakeafzar.com', 'info@shabakeafzar.com', 'سامانه فرادید درایو تست– )2G، 3G، 4G( پایش شبکه های موبایل', 'Faradid drive test system - (2G, 3G, 4G) monitoring of mobile networks', 'This product and its related services are made up of different parts that provide the possibility of checking and evaluating the quality of the mobile network in the field of voice communication and data transmission. The results of these services are used to measure the quality of the operators'' performance, optimize the network and identify and fix the problems in the current networks.'),
  ('شتابدهنده فناوری های مالی نوآفرین', 'noafarinac.ir', 'ceo@noafarinfa.com', '»صندوق پژوهش و فناوری غیردولتی «نوآوران آینده', '"Non-Governmental Research and Technology Fund" Future Innovators', 'This fund is an accelerated innovative product, with the aim of providing financing, venture capital, providing facilities and guarantees, and supporting the creation of ICT for startups and technology companies active in the field of fintech. Future Innovators is the financial arm of innovation development and commercialization of technology in the digital ecosystem'),
  ('شتابدهنده فناوری های مالی نوآفرین', 'noafarinac.ir', 'ceo@noafarinfa.com', '»شرکت «ابتکار فناوری مالی نوآفرین', 'Innovative financial technology initiative company', 'This company operates in the field of crowdfunding and has provided a safe and transparent platform for connecting investors to innovative projects and businesses by obtaining an official license from the Iranian exchange. Innovative financial technology initiative is one of the active players in the capital market in the field of new financial instruments'),
  ('شتابدهنده فناوری های مالی نوآفرین', 'noafarinac.ir', 'ceo@noafarinfa.com', '»شرکت «زنجیره فناوری روزآمد', '"Corporate" chain of modern technology', 'Tal operates and has promoted the use of technology, transparency, efficiency and security in the supply and exchange chain of this specialized market with the B2B chain of modern technology in the field of trade. This company is an example of using technology in traditional markets with an innovative approach'),
  ('شتابدهنده فناوری های مالی نوآفرین', 'noafarinac.ir', 'ceo@noafarinfa.com', '»«کاگنوفیت', '"Cognophyte."', 'Cognofit is an intelligent human resource platform that operates in the field of skills assessment, performance measurement and improvement of human capital productivity. Focusing on data and analysis, this platform helps organizations in making more accurate human resource decisions. These products are a clear manifestation of the innovator''s approach in creating technological businesses and successful commercialization of innovation.'),
  ('طراحان سفید فردا ایرانیان', 'whitedesigners.ir', 'info@whitedesigners.ir', 'گیم سنتر شرکت رایتل', 'Game center of Rytel company', 'Raitel Game Center is one of the innovative projects of "Trahan Sefid" company, which was designed and produced in cooperation with Raitel. With the aim of creating an attractive platform for entertainment, interaction and effective communication with users, this project offers a variety of games to customers in the form of an integrated platform.'),
  ('طراحان سفید فردا ایرانیان', 'whitedesigners.ir', 'info@whitedesigners.ir', 'پروژه بازی شاهین', 'Shahin game project', 'Shahin, an aviation simulation game, has several different modes such as game, online, story, dog fight, daily missions, fighter champions league with accurate simulation and 30 top pilot competitions and... More than .easy control with advanced graphics'),
  ('طراحان سفید فردا ایرانیان', 'whitedesigners.ir', 'info@whitedesigners.ir', 'پروژه بازی سیستان لجندز', 'Sistan Legends game project', 'The game is designed based on the legends and epic poems of Sistan, and the players face Divan and dragons in a mythological world to find the lost rubies and return the sun of Sistan, with characters inspired by Iranian culture and mythology.'),
  ('طراحان سفید فردا ایرانیان', 'whitedesigners.ir', 'info@whitedesigners.ir', 'بازیهای آنالین ایرانی- پروژه زیرساخت قاصد طرح ملی آموزش و توانمندسازی نیروی انسانی مدیریت هوشمند جلسات- پروژه سامانه صبا', 'Iranian online games - Qasid infrastructure project, national training and empowerment plan for human resources, intelligent management of meetings - Saba system project', 'Qased project is a platform to help Iranian game makers to develop online multiplayer games more easily, faster and without dependence on external services. It is designed with the aim of developing specialized skills in the fields of game making, creative industries and artificial intelligence in the country. Considering the importance of content production in the country and the ever-increasing need for expert personnel, this project can play an important role in providing skilled human resources and creating employment. The meeting management and holding system is a set of software and facilities that facilitate and manage organizational meetings and gatherings.'),
  ('فناوران به آفرین ترنج', 'toranjinotec.com', 'info@toranjinotec.com', 'مدیکس', 'Medix', 'Medix is an intelligent system for fully automating the evaluation of medical documents and treatment costs, which replaces manual and paper processes and increases the speed, accuracy, and transparency of claims processing with the electronic processing of documents and the use of artificial intelligence.'),
  ('فناوران به آفرین ترنج', 'toranjinotec.com', 'info@toranjinotec.com', 'دی هلث', 'Day Health', 'Day Health is a digital and secure system for managing the registration and information of supplementary health insurance policyholders, which eliminates traditional and paper processes. This system provides the possibility of registration, management of member changes, data validation and workflow automation. Standard outputs and management dashboard facilitate the insurer''s decision-making. Cloud infrastructure and advanced encryption guarantee security, scalability and reduction of administrative costs'),
  ('فناوران به آفرین ترنج', 'toranjinotec.com', 'info@toranjinotec.com', 'فناور بیمه ای ترنج', 'Tanwar insurance technology', 'Turanj insurance technology is an intelligent system for digital assessment of supplementary treatment claims, which by processing structured data and combining insurance rules and machine learning algorithms, analyzes costs and refers complex cases to human evaluators, increasing speed and accuracy, reducing costs and providing scalability of claims handling.'),
  ('فناوران به آفرین ترنج', 'toranjinotec.com', 'info@toranjinotec.com', ')سپند (سامانه پردازش نوین درمان', '(Spand) New treatment processing system', 'Sepand is a platform to digitize and accelerate the reimbursement of non-contractual medical claims, which enables payments by receiving and evaluating documents and 24/7 automatic settlement mechanisms, and by managing cash flow, improves operational efficiency and the experience of the insured.'),
  ('فناوری ارتباطات نوری دانیال موج', 'danialmoj.com', NULL, 'GBPS 100 تاDWDM وCWDM سیستم های انتقال نوری', 'GBPS 100 to DWDM and CWDM optical transmission systems', 'With the significant increase in the demand for bandwidth in telecommunication and data-oriented networks, especially in areas such as data centers, cloud services and high-quality videos, the capacity of 5G networks of existing optical transmission systems has faced a serious challenge. As one of the most efficient methods to increase optical fiber transmission capacity, DWDM technology allows the simultaneous transmission of several optical channels with different wavelengths on one fiber strand.'),
  ('فناوری ارتباطات نوری دانیال موج', 'danialmoj.com', NULL, 'LoRaWAN شبکهIoT گیت وی', 'LoRaWAN IoT gateway network', 'As one of the products of Daniel Holding, LoRaWAN gateway and smartening of cities and industries, LoRaWAN is considered as the wave of different network infrastructure. This product has an output power of up to 27dBm and supports all versions of Lauraon. It has the node 2000, it also supports the ability to connect directly to the exclusive platform of Danial Moj among the features of this product.'),
  ('فناوری اطالعات و ارتباطات تسنیم', 'tict.ir', 'info@tict.ir', 'نرم افزار جامع اکسس کنترل راهکار یکپارچه تسنیم )FaceID( سامانه سناسایی و تشخیص چهره تسنیم GTS وGRS وGHS سری گیت های', 'Comprehensive access control software, integrated solution of Tasnim (FaceID), facial recognition and recognition system of Tasnim GTS, GRS and GHS series of gates', 'By creating a physical barrier and connecting to biometric and image processing systems, traffic control gates provide mechanized management of personnel presence and RFID guests in high-traffic and sensitive places. These equipments have the possibility of setting access rules and monitoring traffic channels. The target market includes government, military and private institutions with the need to control traffic and attendance.'),
  ('فناوری اطالعات و ارتباطات تسنیم', 'tict.ir', 'info@tict.ir', 'RI و کارتخوان های سریHI دستگاه های حضور و غیاب سری', 'RI and HI series card readers attendance devices series', 'And the RFID sensor of attendance devices and card readers based on fingerprints provide the possibility of independent authentication or connected to systems. This equipment is suitable for administrative and security Access Control applications and has the ability to manage data and cards. The target market includes government, military and private organizations and organizations, residential complexes, entertainment venues, and restaurants. It is an integrated solution for setting up a system for organizational traffic automation with biometrics and image processing, which covers the presence and absence of RFID, traffic control technology, parking management, card issuance, and welfare affairs, and provides the possibility of monitoring regulations and controlling the entry of goods. The target market includes organizations, government and military organizations, companies, entertainment venues, and residential complexes. This system provides the possibility of identifying and authenticating people, recognizing facial features, discovering key objects, and managing access levels with distributed processing of live video streams and camera archives. Live images are displayed for operators and records are accessible in the form of templates and reports'),
  ('فناوری اطالعات و ارتباطات تسنیم', 'tict.ir', 'info@tict.ir', 'PCR-PXB -2 مرکز کنترل', 'PCR-PXB -2 control center', 'The control center of Tasnim system provides the possibility of simultaneous connection to four card readers, management of cards and access levels, registration of elegs and local control of routes. This product is suitable for government, military, private organizations and institutions, residential complexes, entertainment places and restaurants.'),
  ('فناوری اطالعات و ارتباطات تسنیم', 'tict.ir', 'info@tict.ir', 'تسنیم مبتنی بر پروتکل بومیBMS راهکار یکپارچه', 'Tasnim based on the native BMS protocol, an integrated solution', 'Tasnim is a comprehensive software for monitoring BMS infrastructures, a data center and building SCADA solution that monitors and maps equipment performance with a network of sensors and tools. This product is for electricity distribution centers, BTS rooms, data centers, telecommunication centers'),
  ('فناوری اطالعات و ارتباطات تسنیم', 'tict.ir', 'info@tict.ir', '.سرور و سایر زیرساخت های حساس مناسب است75', '75. Server and other sensitive infrastructures are suitable', NULL),
  ('فن تدبیر سبز ویرا', 'ftsv.ir', 'info@ftsv.ir', 'DCIM سامانه کنترل و مانیتورینگ )AIDriven Secure Software Delivery( FarinFabric SmartCtrl SmartPMS', 'DCIM control and monitoring system (AIDriven Secure Software Delivery) FarinFabric SmartCtrl SmartPMS', 'This company increases the efficiency of the system and reduces the risk of operation by more than 30 data points with the comprehensive management of the infrastructure of the center''s DCIM system. The modular design allows easy maintenance, scalability and customization and includes energy, property, capacity and 3D display management. The modules enable full control of the system by monitoring energy consumption, power quality, air circulation and sensor data. GitLab is integrated with DevSecOps, an intelligent FarinFabric platform, and automatically analyzes, secures, and documents Merge Request codes in the Production stage using artificial intelligence and open source CI/CD tools. This system identifies and corrects risks and bugs before entering the code and replaces traditional manual checks. It collects, processes and manages the SCADA equipment data of a SmartCTL industrial controller and sensors and has the ability to send control commands and execute automatic scenarios. This system includes Modbus RTU/TCP with Data Logger and Gateway support. It is used in industries, data centers and smart buildings. It is a multi-channel smart device for monitoring the parameters of electricity and power quality. This system manages energy consumption and optimizes high-consumption points and is used as a channel meter for data centers, 16 and 8.3 smart buildings in large models, hospitals and industries.'),
  ('فن تدبیر سبز ویرا', 'ftsv.ir', 'info@ftsv.ir', 'InfraSense-M-S2-InfraSense سنسورهای دما و رطوبت', 'InfraSense-M-S2-InfraSense temperature and humidity sensors', 'An intelligent and modular InfraSense-M-S2-InfraSense interface for environmental monitoring of data centers and critical infrastructures that collects and transmits temperature, humidity, leakage and door status data, and due to its light and small design, it enables easy installation of Modbus RTU in limited spaces. Freintech precision instruments and S4 and S3 series temperature and humidity sensors are resistant for environmental monitoring of data centers, server rooms, Sensirion systems, and They are industrial equipment that provide accurate data with HVAC sensors that support industrial protocols and optimize environmental control and stability of critical equipment.'),
  ('فنون داده پروری بسامد', NULL, NULL, 'AM-SDR دستگاه مدوالسیون مانیتور مدل', 'AM-SDR modulation device monitor model', 'To monitor the output of AM transmitters, the medium and short wave radio monitor modulation device was designed and previously imported, AM-SDR has been used by the frequency data processing company, the advanced native version produced in 2015 and digital signal processing with SDR technology.'),
  ('فنون داده پروری بسامد', NULL, NULL, 'PECSU دستگاه کنترلر رکتیفایر مدل', 'PECSU rectifier controller device model', 'The management part of a PECSU rectifier system is the Volt model rectifier controller, which is responsible for controlling 48 switching rectifier modules, contactors and current and temperature sensors on DC batteries, loads, and manages the integrated operation of the entire system.'),
  ('فنون داده پروری بسامد', NULL, NULL, 'TCD دستگاه تایم کدر سنکرون رادیویی مدل', 'TCD radio synchronous time coder model', 'The radio synchronous time coder device is designed for synchronizing the input sound (SFN) of medium wave transmitters and creating a single frequency network. This system was implemented in the National KHz Radio Synchronization Project and has the ability to be developed for 558 Iran on other radio networks.'),
  ('فنون داده پروری بسامد', NULL, NULL, 'Z-SDR کارت رادیو نرم افزاری مدل', 'Z-SDR software radio card model', 'And four ZYNQ-7000 are equipped with Z-SDR software radio card processor that send and receive in the range of ADRV9009 and two AD9361 including two MHz RF chips. This 6000 to 700 frequency card is capable of fast signal processing, sampling, signal generation, an SD Card and DDR3 platform, Ethernet, USB and support for It is considered a powerful SDR'),
  ('فنون داده پروری بسامد', NULL, NULL, 'کاناله سونار32 کارت نمونه بردار', 'Sonar 32 channel sample card', 'Artix 7-series FPGA card is equipped with sonar data acquisition. This card receives, synchronizes and frames the data of several 1G cards and five Xilinx network ports of the sonar sampler and sends it to the computer for processing.'),
  ('فنون داده پروری بسامد', NULL, NULL, 'کارت جمع آوری کننده داده سونار', 'Sonar data collector card', '7-Artix FPGA series sonar data collector card, consists of a chip, Xilinx pulse manufacturer and distributor of the company''s product. This card has received the information of 1G hours and five network ports related to several sonar sampler cards through the network ports and after synchronizing and forming new frames'),
  ('فنون داده پروری بسامد', NULL, NULL, '.آنها را به سمت کامپیوتر ارسال می کند79', 'It sends them to the computer79', NULL),
  ('فنی و مهندسی پیشگامان سراج منیر', 'Seraj-kntu.ir', 'info@seraj-kntu.ir', 'GEO آنتن بشقابی کامپوزیتی برای نصب روی ماهواره', 'GEO composite dish antenna for installation on satellite', 'Dish antennas are used in high-altitude orbiting satellites. They must have stable performance in very harsh space conditions. This company has designed, manufactured and tested the given dish-shaped antennas by creating a specialized test infrastructure and offered them as a commercial product. These antennas have the ability to cover around Iran and all their mechanical, thermal and analytical designs are done internally and it is also possible to make customized samples.'),
  ('فنی و مهندسی پیشگامان سراج منیر', 'Seraj-kntu.ir', 'info@seraj-kntu.ir', 'ka متری تمام کامپوزیتی باند2/4 آنتن بشقابی', 'ka meter all composite band 2.4 dish antenna', 'meter, consisting of 2.4 all-composite reflector dish antenna with petal diameter with very high accuracy and ultra-light weight, designed and built for frequency band 16. This antenna is made of Ka composite materials, reinforced with fibers and according to the type of support structure. It has 120 kilometers per hour and the ability to withstand winds with a speed of up to'),
  ('فنی و مهندسی پیشگامان سراج منیر', 'Seraj-kntu.ir', 'info@seraj-kntu.ir', 'ریدوم های کامپوزیتی برای باندهای فرکانسی مختلف', 'Composite radomes for different frequency bands', 'Radomes are protective covers for antennas and telecommunication systems that maintain the performance of equipment against environmental conditions and temperature changes. The design of these covers requires compliance with telecommunication requirements, structural strength and minimal signal loss. The company with experience in making commercial samples for different bands has specially optimized the material, structure and porcelain layer of the radomes.'),
  ('فنی و مهندسی پیشگامان سراج منیر', 'Seraj-kntu.ir', 'info@seraj-kntu.ir', 'چسب پایه اپوکسی آلتراباند', 'Ultrabond epoxy base glue', 'Adhesives are widely used in various industries such as stone, wood, leather and composite, and their formulation is optimized based on needs. Peshgaman Siraj Munir Company has developed Araldite 2015, a flexible product for components under vibration, by researching epoxy-based adhesives. This adhesive has a superior performance in terms of strength and flexibility'),
  ('کنترل پردازنده', 'controlpardazandeh.com', 'info@controlpardazandeh.com', 'قابل برنامه ریزی و مجهز به پروتکل های استاندارد تله کنترلRTU', 'Programmable and equipped with standard RTU remote control protocols', 'This system is used as a local and remote controller in the broadband and cellular industries, and by supporting various industrial protocols and communication ports, it provides the possibility of monitoring transmitters and field signals, issuing commands to digital and analog mechanisms, and connecting to quality and energy analyzers are among its capabilities. Also, the system has the ability to be developed and integrated through the network and is of great importance in the water, electricity, oil and gas industries.'),
  ('کنترل پردازنده', 'controlpardazandeh.com', 'info@controlpardazandeh.com', '2G/2.5G/3G/4G/LTE مودم و روتر صنعتی HMI', '2G/2.5G/3G/4G/LTE modem and HMI industrial router', 'The user interface with the process controller in the form of color graphics and with the possibility of touching the screen to go through the lists and insert values and equipped with Ethernet and serial communication ports and based on the standard Modbus / rtu communication protocols'),
  ('کنترل پردازنده', 'controlpardazandeh.com', 'info@controlpardazandeh.com', 'کنترلر پایش فیدرهای زمینی و هوایی شبکه توزیع برق', 'Monitoring controller of ground and aerial feeders of electricity distribution network', 'This is a local controller system for monitoring and controlling medium voltage power distribution networks, which is installed in ground and aerial substations. It applies local and remote commands to the control centers and DNP3 by accurately reading the parameters. The data is sent through advanced protocols such as central monitoring. provides It is used in wide and scattered industries such as water, dedicated electricity, APN compatibility system, gas and mines. By taking full advantage of internal cellular networks, it guarantees'),
  ('کنترل پردازنده', 'controlpardazandeh.com', 'info@controlpardazandeh.com', 'ماژول ایزوله ورودی آنالوگ هشت کاناله', 'Eight-channel analog input isolation module', 'The analog information acquisition module provides the ability to connect to Modbus/current and voltage transmitters and analyzers and the RS485 protocol, and is connected to controllers and monitoring systems through RTU, and has the ability to monitor hydraulic, electrical and similar parameters.'),
  ('کنترل پردازنده', 'controlpardazandeh.com', 'info@controlpardazandeh.com', ')FTU(', '(FTU)', NULL),
  ('گرین وب سامانه نوین', 'greenweb.ir', 'info@greenweb.ir', 'ابر گرین وب سکوی ابری پردازش گرافیکی شبکه توزیع محتوای ابری سکوی ابری بالکچین', 'Cloud Green Web, cloud platform, graphic processing, cloud content distribution network, cloud platform, blockchain', 'Blockchain is a type of decentralized infrastructure for recording information and reports, the main difference from other systems is that the data stored in this network is shared among all members in a completely secure manner and minimizes the possibility of theft or manipulation of information. Cost-effective, it optimizes the implementation of computing projects in universities, research centers, companies and startups and paves the way to create a smarter future. Green Web has increased the availability and scalability of cloud services by providing cloud servers and specialized virtual machines for data and artificial intelligence. Green Web cloud services provide implementation, management and scalability It makes the services simple and flexible'),
  ('گرین وب سامانه نوین', 'greenweb.ir', 'info@greenweb.ir', 'سکوی ابری ورد پرس', 'Wordpress cloud platform', 'The WordPress cloud service provides the possibility of hosting and running WordPress websites on the cloud infrastructure and provides users with higher security, flexibility and scalability according to their needs.'),
  ('گرین وب سامانه نوین', 'greenweb.ir', 'info@greenweb.ir', 'سکوی پردازش ابری کوبرنتیز', 'Kubernetes cloud processing platform', 'Kubernetes manages containers in pods and distributes them on servers to make implementation and control simple and efficient, and Green Web makes development and implementation easy by providing a ready-made cluster (a collection of geographically distributed CDN servers) is a content distribution network that stores a copy of website content in different data centers and provides it to the user from the nearest point. and page loading speed increases. Improves the website and provides a faster and more stable user experience.'),
  ('گسترش خدمات کارا تلفن', 'karatelecom.com', 'Gostaresh.karatelephone@gmail.com', 'K10 تلفن', 'K10 phone', 'It is a simple-to-use office phone with rich functions, quality, beautiful design, support for multiple languages, HD, loud sound'),
  ('گسترش خدمات کارا تلفن', 'karatelecom.com', 'Gostaresh.karatelephone@gmail.com', 'ONT-KG542 مودم', 'ONT-KG542 Modem', 'Dual mode (simultaneous support XPON is a device KG-542 dual-band optical modem integrated Wi-Fi 5) which is designed with EPON and GPON and is used as the ultimate optical fiber solution for operators. This modem supports high bandwidth, offers features and has VoIP, Gigabit Ethernet and Wi-Fi, such as routing, GE port 4 and user ports including GEPON upstream ports. WLAN Wi-Fi 5 and VoIP, one USB port, one port'),
  ('گسترش خدمات کارا تلفن', 'karatelecom.com', 'Gostaresh.karatelephone@gmail.com', 'OLT-KFH2016-C', 'OLT-KFH2016-C', 'Or "optical line terminal" acts as the heart of fiber optic networks in OLT architecture. This equipment is installed in the telecommunication center or in the EPON and GPON room, the main equipment and is responsible for managing and controlling the connection between the data network from the central OLT network and the end users (receives and sends subscribers through optical fiber cables as backbone). In the ONU or ONT path, the optical signal also collects the users'' data and returns it to the main network (splitter) can be used through the OLT optical splitters of each port of tens or It can serve even hundreds of subscribers at the same time, which significantly saves money and equipment.'),
  ('گسترش خدمات کارا تلفن', 'karatelecom.com', 'Gostaresh.karatelephone@gmail.com', 'KARA DS1000-IP-Base مرکز تلفن', 'KARA DS1000-IP-Base telephone center', 'A communication system for transferring KARA DS IP-Base model is a 100% telephone center with a variety of interfaces with Voice and Data traffic capacity. In this system, you will be able to create all kinds of structures according to the needs of your organization with different combinations. This and from the Sip Trunk-E1PRI-E&M-Co system from the trunk side with lines and IP, two-wire secretary-subscriber side with analog users, digital boss. Can be connected DECT or subscribers'),
  ('مانا اندیشه ستاره خاوران', 'manaandisheh.com', 'manandisheh@gmail.com', ')Bus-Validator( دستگاه کارت خوان کاهنده', '(Bus-Validator) reducer card reader device', NULL),
  ('مشاور نرم افزار محک (سهامی خاص)', 'mahaksoft.com', 'info@nbgme.net', 'نرم افزار حسابداری فروشگاهی محک', 'Benchmark store accounting software', 'Mahek store accounting software is a comprehensive solution for financial management and accounting of retail and wholesale stores, which includes warehouse management, quick sales, accurate reporting and connection to store tools such as barcode readers and card readers, and makes the daily operations of businesses simple and efficient.'),
  ('مشاور نرم افزار محک (سهامی خاص)', 'mahaksoft.com', 'info@nbgme.net', 'نرم افزار حسابداری شرکتی محک', 'Benchmark corporate accounting software', 'Mahek corporate accounting software with advanced features, simple user interface and high security, simplifies and secures the financial management of small to large companies and turns complex processes into fast and reliable results.'),
  ('مشاور نرم افزار محک (سهامی خاص)', 'mahaksoft.com', 'info@nbgme.net', 'نرم افزار حسابداری تولیدی محک', 'Benchmark production accounting software', 'Mehek''s production accounting software is designed with the aim of simplifying production management and control of costs and inventory of raw materials and is offered at two levels, general and commercial, so that businesses can choose the best tool according to the needs and volume of their activity.'),
  ('مشاور نرم افزار محک (سهامی خاص)', 'mahaksoft.com', 'info@nbgme.net', 'افزونه اتوماسیون خدمات و تعمیرات', 'Service and repair automation plugin', 'The service and repair automation plugin covers all the processes in the way of providing technical services and repairs and helps in better business management by providing statistical and analytical reports.'),
  ('مشاور نرم افزار محک (سهامی خاص)', 'mahaksoft.com', 'info@nbgme.net', 'افزونه سیستم چندارزی', 'Multicurrency system plugin', 'The multi-currency system add-on simplifies the operation of foreign exchange transactions and the currency exchange process. Using this plugin, you can easily specify your desired currency and define its amount when buying or selling.'),
  ('مشاور نرم افزار محک (سهامی خاص)', 'mahaksoft.com', 'info@nbgme.net', 'افزونه سیستم بایگانی اسناد و دبیرخانه', 'Extension of document filing system and secretariat', 'The add-on of the document filing system and the secretariat is a comprehensive and efficient solution for managing documents and organizational correspondence. This plugin significantly facilitates the process of registering, archiving and tracking incoming and outgoing letters by providing advanced features.'),
  ('نرم افزاری امن پرداز', 'amnpardaz.com', 'info@amnpardaz.com', 'الیه هوشمند محافظت از داده و دفاع پیشگیرانه', 'Intelligent layer of data protection and preventive defense', 'Data protection against ransomware, unauthorized access and network threats is one of the key challenges of organizations. Aman Pardaz solution, a new generation platform with five layers of protection against ransomware and comprehensive data protection and network policy capabilities, provides a behavior-based approach to organizational security. This solution, which has all the main capabilities of Padus (except antivirus), coexists with other security products. Therefore, it is a safe option for organizations that focus on data integrity and resilience against ransomware'),
  ('نرم افزاری امن پرداز', 'amnpardaz.com', 'info@amnpardaz.com', 'محافظت پیشرفته نقاط پایانی', 'Advanced endpoint protection', 'In the face of complex cyber threats, organizations need integrated control. Aman Pardaz solution with a combination of advanced anti-malware technologies, data protection, behavioral detection and network defense provides this and Base integration. This solution, which is offered in two versions with various capabilities, can be controlled centrally through the Corporate Console.'),
  ('نرم افزاری امن پرداز', 'amnpardaz.com', 'info@amnpardaz.com', 'راهکار مدیریت شده و یکپارچه تشخیص و پاسخ سازمانی', 'Managed and integrated organizational diagnosis and response solution', 'In many organizations, the high volume of security incidents, the dispersion of threat data in the offending layers, and the lack of specialist forces cause some of the complex attacks to be detected late, or not seen at all. The combination of heterogeneous tools, the lack of integration between network data, the end point of Internet and cloud services, and the lack of continuous monitoring make organizations lose the ability to detect multi-stage threats and the operational load of SOC teams continues to increase. Aman Pardaz solution: the comprehensive and intelligent center of diagnosis and response of Padavish offers analysis power that combines network data, 24x7 points and security operations expert team, a monitoring layer of XDR AI platform. Final, internet services and cloud space are analyzed in a closed flow.'),
  ('نرم افزاری امن پرداز', 'amnpardaz.com', 'info@amnpardaz.com', 'درگاه مجازی امن و کنترل شده برای ورود فایل ها به شبکه سازمان', 'Secure and controlled virtual portal for entering files into the organization''s network', 'Portable media is one of the most common entry routes for malware and unauthorized content. Without an interface to check behavior, multi-step scanning and apply security policies, files can infect the system before detection. Some organizations use hardware kiosks to solve this challenge; A solution that due to the frequent need to visit the kiosk, the geographical dispersion of the kiosks, the creation of additional work traffic and so on'),
  ('نرم افزاری امن پرداز', 'amnpardaz.com', 'info@amnpardaz.com', 'باPadvish vKiosk™ : هزینه های نگه داری مشکالت مضاعفی را برای سازمان ایجاد می کند. راهکار امن پرداز', 'With Padvish vKiosk™: Maintenance costs create additional problems for the organization. safe solution', 'Creating a secure and isolated path virtually without hardware deployment issues, checks files before reaching the system, multi-engine scanning, file inspection based on USB policy. Organizational access control, and user behavior analysis make this product a vital and easy-to-use gateway for portable media security.'),
  ('نور بهینه گستر خاورمیانه', 'nbgme.com', 'info@nbgme.net', 'میکروداکت فیبر نوری با پوشش داخلی سیلیکون', 'Fiber optic microduct with silicone inner coating', 'Fiber optic microducts are small and flexible channels that guide optical fibers safely and effectively and make network installation and expansion faster and less expensive. Their diameter is usually 16 mm and they are made of polyethylene with silicone inner coating. Microducts can be single-tube or multi-tube within a larger duct'),
  ('نور بهینه گستر خاورمیانه', 'nbgme.com', 'info@nbgme.net', ')رابط فیبر نوری (انواع پچکورد و پیگتیل', 'Fiber optic interface (types of patch cord and pigtail', 'Fiber optic pigtail is a short fiber cable that has a connector on one end and no connector on the other end. Usually, the end without a connector is fused to the main fiber and is used in a patch panel or fiber box: an optical fiber patch cord is a cable that has a connector on both ends for connection. ODF is used directly on network equipment such as switches, routers, patch panels'),
  ('نور بهینه گستر خاورمیانه', 'nbgme.com', 'info@nbgme.net', 'مفصل میکروداکت فیبر نوری', 'Fiber optic microduct joint', 'A microduct joint is a precision mechanical connector designed to connect two or more microducts so that the path of the fiber cable remains perfectly aligned and the tail air pressure is maintained. This connector prevents the penetration of water, dust and pollution and does not weld the fiber itself, but rather protects the passage of the fiber inside the microduct (Micro Duct Fiber Joint / Connector).'),
  ('نور بهینه گستر خاورمیانه', 'nbgme.com', 'info@nbgme.net', 'کانکتور و مسدود کننده میکروداکت فیبر نوری', 'Fiber optic microduct connector and blocker', 'Connectors are used to directly connect two pieces of microduct and make fiber optic transmission without any interruptions and with minimal losses. Their internal design is such that they can hold the microducts firmly and securely in place and prevent leakage or failure. Installation of microduct connectors is very simple and fast and does not require complicated tools'),
  ('نسیم فدک ایرانیان', 'nasimfadak.com', 'info@nasimfadak.com', 'سامانه دسترسی سریع به اطالعات پروازی', 'Quick access system to flight information', 'QAR is a small part of the plane that is able to receive and store flight information from two sources in one accessible position. QAR automatically enables the information in two sources, one is a two gigabyte removable memory card and the second is a QAR number. Saves SD micro memory card or internal Wi-Fi automatically as soon as the plane touches the ground on the website of the SD plane, the information obtained through the card is loaded.'),
  ('ونداد ویرا هومان', 'parspack.com', 'info@parspack.com', 'CDN', 'CDN', 'Content distribution network is an advanced solution to increase the speed, security and stability of websites. Using a set of powerful and distributed servers in different parts of Iran and the world, this service provides the content of the website to the end user from the nearest server; As a result, page loading time is minimized and the user experience is dramatically improved'),
  ('ونداد ویرا هومان', 'parspack.com', 'info@parspack.com', 'Host', 'Host', 'In our cloud hosting, the main goal is to improve customer user experience and simplify service management. The integrated and cloud user panel provides users with a variety of hosting facilities without the need to directly interact with complex control panels and makes the service management process simple and efficient for them. The powerful and cloud infrastructure of this panel provides the possibility of providing stable, fast and secure services'),
  ('ونداد ویرا هومان', 'parspack.com', 'info@parspack.com', 'Server Paas (Platform as a Service)', 'Server Paas (Platform as a Service)', 'A cloud server is a platform that allows users to set up a virtual server with their desired operating system at any time and with just a few clicks. All the steps of creating and preparing the server are done in a short period of time, and the user will have immediate access to the server environment. These servers have real-time scalability by using cloud computing technology; In such a way that users can automatically increase the hardware resources they need at any time, without the need to contact support. It is a model of cloud computing that provides infrastructure and software development tools to technical teams without the need to manage servers. This model provides a scalable, secure and flexible environment and increases developers'' focus on coding and business logic, while reducing costs and accelerating the development cycle.'),
  ('ونداد ویرا هومان', 'parspack.com', 'info@parspack.com', 'Cloud Storage', 'Cloud Storage', 'Cloud storage is a safe, stable and available platform for storing and managing data at different scales. This multi-tenant design service relies on powerful cloud infrastructure and architecture so that users can store their data in an isolated environment with the highest level of security and availability.'),
  ('همیان فن', 'Hamianfan.com', 'info@hamianfan.com', ') ( رله حفاظتی اضافه جریان و اتصال زمین1055 رله HF1034 رله حفاظتی اضافه جریان و اتصال زمین', ') Overcurrent protection relay and ground connection 1055 Relay HF1034 Overcurrent protection relay and ground connection', 'This relay detects short circuit and overload by continuously monitoring network currents and isolates the faulty part by sending a signal to the power switches. Equipped with five current transformers, including a ground sensitive transformer, this relay provides phase overcurrent protection, ground connection, automatic reclosing. It provides thermal load monitoring and inrush current detection. This relay detects abnormal currents such as short circuit and overload. And by sending a signal to the power switches, it isolates the faulty part. Its capabilities include phase and ground overcurrent protection, automatic reclosing (Cold Load Pickup), thermal load monitoring and inrush current detection. Prevents equipment'),
  ('همیان فن', 'Hamianfan.com', 'info@hamianfan.com', ') رله حفاظت ترانسفورماتور ( دو سیم پیچهHF6028 تابلو زمینی', '(Transformer protection relay) HF6028 two coils, ground panel', 'This relay provides fast fault detection, differential protection, limited earth fault, temperature protection and overcurrent backup to protect transformers in substations and industries and increase their life. The kilovolt is one of the main equipments of 20 medium pressure ground panel systems of electricity distribution, which provides the possibility of controlling, monitoring, protecting and disconnecting and connecting different parts of the medium pressure network. These signs are usually installed in distribution substations, distribution stations, industrial centers, power plants, and large residential or commercial complexes.'),
  ('همیان فن', 'Hamianfan.com', 'info@hamianfan.com', 'رله حفاظتی جریان دار HF1028', 'Current protection relay HF1028', 'This relay is designed to control and protect distribution networks and sub-distribution substations and prevents equipment damage by providing phase and earth overcurrent protections, voltage, frequency and thermal load monitoring. It is equipped with automatic reclosing and fault direction detection in circular and parallel networks. It can also act as a backup relay for distance relays.'),
  ('همیان فن', 'Hamianfan.com', 'info@hamianfan.com', 'رله حفاظتی اضافه جریان و اتصال زمینHF1024', 'HF1024 overcurrent protection relay and ground connection', 'This relay detects short circuit and overload by continuously monitoring the circuit current and isolates the faulty part by sending a signal to the power switches. Its capabilities include phase and ground overcurrent protection, monitoring, cold load pickup, and inrush current detection.'),
  ('هوشمند سازان بیتا', 'hsbco.ir', 'Info@hsbco.ir', 'انواع گیت ها، سخت افزارها و نرم افزارهای کنترل تردد', 'All types of gates, hardware and traffic control software', 'The comprehensive organizational traffic control system designed and produced by the Beta Smart Makers Company is an integrated solution consisting of physical barriers, software, hardware and smart identifiers to control and manage the traffic of people to organizations on foot or by car. With the support of biometric technologies, including facial and fingerprint recognition, cards, this system provides the possibility of centralized and intelligent management of the traffic of employees and clients. This QR Code, fingerprint reader and RFID system, with high expandability and scalability, flexibility in implementation and the ability to integrate with other organizational systems, creates a stable and safe platform for improving security and increasing the productivity of organizations. Also with the ability to support traffic. 1000 people per hour and the possibility of online and offline operation, it meets the needs of large and high-traffic organizations, and also having an integrated HSE system, providing detailed reports and documentation for security units, human resources, and managing the traffic of employees and clients, is one of the other capabilities of this comprehensive solution.')
), matched AS (
  SELECT c.company_id, t.product_name, t.name_en, t.description_en
  FROM exhibition_companies c JOIN translations t ON c.name = t.company_name
    OR (t.email IS NOT NULL AND lower(c.email) = lower(t.email))
    OR (t.website IS NOT NULL AND lower(regexp_replace(c.website, '^https?://(www\.)?', '')) = lower(regexp_replace(t.website, '^https?://(www\.)?', '')))
)
UPDATE exhibition_products p SET name_en = m.name_en, description_en = m.description_en
FROM matched m WHERE p.company_id = m.company_id AND p.name = m.product_name;
